<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Goofa</book>
  <para style="h">Yohaannisa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoha</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohaannisa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yohaannisi Xaafida Yesuus Kiristtoosa Wonggelaa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohaannisi Xaafida</para>
  <para style="mt2">Yesuus Kiristtoosa Wonggelaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohaannisi Yesuusa, “Ase gididi asaa giddon benttida Xoossaa Qaala” yaagidi qonccisees. Ha Wonggelay xaafettiday iya nabbabiya asay Yesuusi asaa ashsheyssa gididi yaana geetettida Xoossaa Na7aa gideyssa ammanana melanne iyan ammaneyssatas merinaa de7oy de7eyssa entti erana melassa (20:31).</para>
  <para style="ip">Wonggelaas koyro kifiley merinabaa gidida Xoossaa qaalaynne Yesuusi issino gideyssa odi simmidi, Yesuusi ashsheyssa gididi yaana gida Xoossaa Na7aa gideyssa bessiya dumma dumma malaatata qonccisees. Xaafey, Yesuus Kiristtoosi ba huu7en tuma Xoossaa Na7anne Xoossaa aawara issino gideyssa (1:1) bolla qonccisis. Yesuusi ba huu7en ta Abrahameppe kase de7ays (8:58) yaagis. Wurssethan Toomasi, “Ta Godaw, ta Xoossaw” yaagidi xeegis (20:28). Hessafe kaallidi qassi ha malaatatappe benttida ayfiyaa odiya taariketi kaalloosona. Ha kifiley issi issi asay Yesuusa ammanidi iya kaalleyssata gididayssa odees; qassi harati iyara waanidi eqettidaakkonne waanidi ammanonna ixxidaakko odoosona. Shemppo 13-17 gakkanaw Yesuusi oykettida omarssi iyaw iya tamaaretara ay mela mino gaytethi de7iyakko, qassi wonttetha gallas kaqettanaappe sinthe giigetetha qaalanne minthetho qaala enttaw odidayssa qonccisees. Wurssetha shemppoti Yesuusi oykettidaabanne pirddas shiiqidabaa, iya kaqetethaanne iya dendduwa, hessadakka dendduwaafe guye ba tamaaretas I qonccida qonccethabaa odoosona.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yohaannisa Wonggelaa ayfe qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo qofaa 1:1-18</para>
  <para style="io1">Xammaqiya Yohaannisanne Yesuusa koyro tamaareta 1:19-51</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuusi qonccen ooso oykkoyssa 2:1-12:50</para>
  <para style="io1">Wurssetha qammata Yerusalaame heeran 13:1-19:42</para>
  <para style="io1">Godaa dendduwanne qonccethaa 20:1-31</para>
  <para style="io1">Kuushsha qofaa: Galiilan zaaridi ba tamaaretas qonccoyssa 21:1-25</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">De7o qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Qaalay koyro de7ees. Qaalaykka Xoossaara de7ees; he Qaalay Xoossaa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Koyroppe Qaalay Xoossaara de7ees. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Xoossay ubbabaa Qaalaa baggara medhdhis. Medhettidabaappe issoykka iya baggara medhettonabay baawa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Iyan de7oy de7ees; he de7oy asaas poo7o. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Poo7oy dhuman poo7ees; dhumay poo7uwa xoonibeenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Xoossay kiittida, issi Yohaannisa giya asi de7ees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:1">Maato 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mar 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-2">Luuqa 3:1-2</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v"/>Asa ubbay poo7uwan ammanana mela I poo7os markka gididi yis. <verse number="8" style="v"/>I poo7uwabaa markkattanaw yisippe attin ba huu7en poo7o gidenna. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Asa ubbaas poo7isiya tuma poo7oy alamiya yees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Qaalay alamen de7is. Xoossay Qaalan alamiya medhdhis, shin alamey iya eribeenna. <verse number="11" style="v"/>I bayssatakko yis, shin iyayssati iya ekkibookkona. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Shin I bana ekkidayssatasinne iya sunthan ammanidayssatas Xoossaa nayta gidana mela maata immis. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Entti Xoossafe yelettidosonappe attin asi yelettiya wogan woykko adde shenen woykko asa amon yelettibookkona. Xoossay I entta aawa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Qaalay ase gidis; aadho keehatethaanne tumaa kumidi nu giddon de7is. I aawas issi na7aa gididi ekkida iya bonchchuwa nuuni be7ida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yohaannisi iyabaa markkattis. Ba qaalaa dhoqqu oothidi, “Taani, ‘Taappe guyera yeyssi taappe kase de7iya gisho taappe aadhdhees’ gada markkattidayssi hayssa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nuuni ubbay iya aadho keehatethaa kumethaafe anjjo bolla anjjo ekkida. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Xoossay higgiya Muse baggara immis, shin aadho keehatethaynne tumatethay Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara yis. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Xoossaa be7ida asi oonikka baawa; ba Aawa matan de7iya issi Na7aa xalaali baw Xoosse gididayssi iya qonccisis.</para>
  <para style="s">Xammaqiya Yohaannisa markkatethaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Maato 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-8">Luuqa 3:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yerusalaamen de7iya Ayhude halaqati, kahinetanne Leeweta, “Neeni oonee?” gidi, Yohaannisa oychchana mela iyaakko kiittin, Yohaannisi enttaw markkattida markkatethay hayssa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yohaannisi, “Taani Kiristtoosa gidikke” yaagidi, geeshshidi markkattisippe attin kaddibeenna.</para>
  <para style="rem">fig 13 fig*</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Entti, “Yaatin, neeni oonee? Neeni Eliyaaseyye?” yaagidi oychchidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Mil 4:5; <ref loc="DEU 18:15-18">Zaare 18:15-18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">Yohaannisi, “Akkay gidikke” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Qassi entti, “Neeni yaana geetettida nabiyayye?” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">Yohaannisi, “Akkay” gidi zaaris.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yaatin, “Neeni oonee? Nuuni nuna kiittidayssatas odana mela neeni nena oona gay?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yohaannisi zaaridi, “Nabiya Isayaasi gidayssada,</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Godaa ogiya suurisite!’</para>
  <para style="q2">gidi bazzo biittan waassiya uraa qaalay tana”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa 40:3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Qassi Farisaaweti kiittida asati <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yohaannisakko, “Neeni Kiristtoosa woykko Eliyaasa woykko nabe gidonna ixxiko, yaatin ays xammaqay?” gidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yohaannisi zaaridi, “Taani haathan xammaqays, shin hintte eronna asi hintte giddon eqqis. <verse number="27" style="v"/>I taappe guyera yees. Taani hari attoshin iya caammaa wodoruwa billanaw bessike” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hessi ubbay Yorddaanose Shaafappe hefinthan, Bitaaniya giya biittan, Yohaannisi xammaqiya bessan hanis.</para>
  <para style="s">Xoossaa Dorssaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yohaannisi wonttetha gallas Yesuusi baakko yishin be7idi, “Alamiya nagara quchchiya Xoossaa Dorssay hayssa! <verse number="30" style="v"/>Taani, ‘Taappe guyera issi asi yaana. I taappe kase de7iya gisho taappe aadhdhees’ gada odidayssi hayssa. <verse number="31" style="v"/>I ooneekko taani erikke. Shin Isra7eele asaas iya qonccisanaw haathan xammaqashe yas” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yohaannisi hayssada yaagidi markkattis: “Geeshsha Ayyaanay saloppe holeda wodhdhishininne iyara de7ishin be7as. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hessi hananaappe kase taani iya erikke. Shin haathan xammaqanaw tana kiittida Xoossay, ‘Geeshsha Ayyaanay wodhdhidi iyara de7ishin neeni be7anaysinne Geeshsha Ayyaanan xammaqanayssi iya’ yaagidi taw odis. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Taani hessi hanishin be7ada, I Xoossaa Na7aa gididayssa markkattays” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa kaallida koyro tamaareta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Qassi wonttetha gallas Yohaannisi ba tamaaretappe nam77atara issife eqqis. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesuusi aadhdhishin Yohaannisi be7idi, “Xoossaa dorssay haysish!” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yohaannisa nam77u tamaareti Yohaannisi geyssa si7idi Yesuusa kaallidosona. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesuusi bana kaalleyssata guye simmi be7idi, “Ay koyeetii?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">Entti zaaridi, “Asttamaariyaw, neeni awun de7ay?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako, “Haa yidi be7ite” yaagis. Entti bidi I de7iyasuwa be7idosona. He gallas sa7ay tammu saate heera gidiya gisho iya matan pee7idosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yohaannisi gidayssa si7idi, Yesuusa kaallida nam77u tamaaretappe issoy, Simoon Phexiroosa ishaa Inddiriyasa. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Inddiriyasi koyro ba ishaa Simoonara gayttidi, “Nuuni Kiristtoosa demmida” yaagis. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Inddiriyasi Simoona Yesuusakko ehis.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi Simoona be7idi, “Neeni Yoona na7aa Simoona; ne sunthay Keefa <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:42 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Keefa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giya qaalay Aramayke doona gidishin, Girike doonan birshshethay Phexiroosa woykko zaalla guussu.</char></note> gidi xeegettana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Filiphphoosanne Natina7eela xeegis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Wonttetha gallas Yesuusi Galiila biittaa baanaw qofa qachchis. I Filiphphoosara gayttidi, “Tana kaalla!” yaagis. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Filiphphoosi, Inddiriyasinne Phexiroosi de7ida Beetesayda giya katamaappe yida ase.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Filiphphoosi Natina7eelara gayttidi, “Musey higge maxaafan, qassi nabetikka iyabaa xaafida Yoosefa na7aa Naazirete Yesuusa nuuni demmida” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Natina7eeli zaaridi, “Naazirete katamaappe lo77obay keyanaw dandda7ii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Filiphphoosi, “Yada be7a” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Natina7eeli baakko yeyssa Yesuusi be7idi, “Geney baynna tuma Isra7eele asi hayssa!” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Natina7eeli Yesuusakko, “Neeni tana awun eray?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi zaaridi, “Filiphphoosi nena xeeganaappe sinthe, neeni balase mithaa garssan de7ishin taani nena be7as” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Natina7eeli zaaridi, “Asttamaariyaw, neeni Xoossaa Na7aa! Neeni Isra7eele kawo!” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesuusi iyaakko, “Taani nena balase mithee garssan be7as gida gisho ammanay? Neeni hayssafe aadhdhiyabaa be7ana!” yaagis. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Qassi Yesuusi, “Taani hinttew tuma odays; saloy dooyettin, Xoossaa kiitanchchoti Asa Na7aa bolla keyishininne wodhdhishin hintte be7ana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:12">Medhe 28:12</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi yaagano bessan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Heedzantho gallas Galiila biittan Qaana kataman yaaganoy yaaganettis. Yesuusa aayiya he yaaganuwan de7awusu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesuusikka ba tamaaretara issife he yaaganuwa xeegettis. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Woyne ushshay wurin, Yesuusa aayiya Yesuusakko, “Enttaw woyne ushshay wuris” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Ta aaye, ne hayssan geloppa? Ta wodey buroo gakkibeenna” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesuusa aayiya oosanchchotakko, “I hinttew odiyabaa aybibaa gidikkoka oothite” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ayhudeti bantta geesho wogaas go7ettiya usuppun shuchcha baathati he bessan de7oosona. Issi issi baathay nam77u woykko heedzu xugga oykkees. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesuusi oosanchchotakko, “Baathatan haathe kunthite” yaagis. Entti baathatas doona gakkanaw haathe kunthidosona. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako, “Ha77i duuqqidi yaaganuwa halaafiyas immite” yaagis. Entti iyaw efidi immidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yaaganuwa halaafey woyne ushshi laamettida haathaa ganxi ekkidi awuppe yidaakko eribeenna, shin haathaa kunthida oosanchchoti eroosona. Yaaganuwa halaafey machchiw ekkeyssa xeegidi, <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Oonikka lo77o woyne ushshaa asaa koyrottidi ushshees. Yaatidi asay uyi kallidaappe guye, qiraariya immees. Shin neeni lo77o woyne ushshaa hanno gakkanaw wotha aggadasa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesuusi ha koyro malaataa Galiila biittan Qaana kataman oothis; hessan ba gitatethaa bessis. Iya tamaareti iya ammanidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi ba aayera, ba ishataranne ba tamaaretara issife Qifirnahoome giya katamaa bidi guutha gallas gam77is.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:13">Maato 4:13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Xoossaa Keethafe zal77eyssata kessis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Maato 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mar 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luuqa 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ayhudeti bonchchiya Faasika Baale gallasay matatin Yesuusi Yerusalaame bis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Kessa 12:1-27</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v"/>Bidi Xoossa Keethan boorata, miizata, dorssatanne holleta bayzeyssatanne bantta oydiyan uttidi miishe laammeyssata demmis. <verse number="15" style="v"/>I xurqqafe dooqidi asaa ubbaa entta mehetara Xoossa Keethafe gooddidi kare kessis. Miishe laammeyssata xarpheezatakka aathi yeggidi entta miishiya laallis. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Holle bayzeyssata, “Ha holleta hayssafe kessite; ta Aawa keetha giya oothofite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Iya tamaareti Geeshsha Maxaafan, “Taani ne keethas mishettiya mishay tana tamada xuuggees” geetettidi xaafettidayssa akeekidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Maz 69:9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Ayhudeti zaaridi, “Ne hayssa oothanaw new maati de7eyssas nuna ay malaata oothada bessanee?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Ha Xoossaa Keetha laallite; taani heedzu gallasan zaarada keexana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:61">Maato 26:61</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:40">27:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:58">Mar 14:58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:29">15:29</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Qassika Ayhudeti, “Ha Xoossa Keetha keexanaw oytamanne usuppun laythi ekkis, shin neeni heedzu gallasan keexanee?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi odiya Xoossa Keethay ba asatethaabaa. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Yesuusi hayqoppe denddidaappe guye iya tamaareti I hessa gidayssa akeekidosona. Qassi entti Xoossaa maxaafan xaafettidayssanne Yesuusi odidayssa ammanidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesuusi Faasika bonchchiya bessan Yerusalaamen de7ishin, I oothida malaatata be7idi daro asay iya ammanidosona. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi asaa ubbaa eriya gisho entta ammanibeenna. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Asa wozanan de7iyabaa I ba huu7en eriya gisho asabaa oonikka iyaw odana mela koshshibeenna.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusanne Niqodimoosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Farisaaweta yaraappe gidida, Ayhudeta halaqay, Niqodimoosa giya issi addey de7ees. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Niqodimoosi qamma Yesuusakko yidi, “Asttamaariyaw, neeni Xoossay kiittida asttamaare gideyssa nuuni eroos. Ays giikko, Xoossay iyara doonna ixxiko ha neeni oothiya malaata oothanaw dandda7iya asi baawa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani new tuma odays; oonikka zaari yelettonna ixxiko Xoossaa kawotethaa be7anaw dandda7enna” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Niqodimoosi, “Ceega asi waanidi zaari yelettanaw dandda7ii? Ba aaye ulo simmi gelidi zaari yelettanaw dandda7ii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani new tuma odays; oonikka haathafenne Geeshsha Ayyaanaappe yelettonna attiko, Xoossaa kawotethaa gelanaw dandda7enna. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Asho na7atethi aawuppenne aayippe yees; Xoossaa na7atethi Geeshsha Ayyaanaappe imettees. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Taani, ‘Hintte zaari yelettanaw bessees’ gada hinttew odida gisho neeni malaalettof. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Carkkoy ba koyida bessi carkkees. Neeni iya kooshinchcha si7asappe attin I awuppe yaakko woykko aw biyakko erakka. Ayyaanaappe yelettida ubbay hessa mela” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yaatin Niqodimoosi, “Hessi waanidi hananaw dandda7ii?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Neeni Isra7eelata asttamaare gidashe hayssa erikkii? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Taani new tuma odays; nu ereyssa odoosinne be7idabaa markkattoos, shin nu markkatethaa hintte ekkeketa. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Taani hinttew sa7abaa odin hintte ammanonnabaa gidikko salobaa odin waati ammananee? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Saloppe wodhdhida Asa Na7aappe attin salo keyiday oonikka baawa; [salon de7iya Asa Na7ay tana]” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Salon de7iya Asa Na7ay tana: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Issi issi beni maxaafati gujjoosona.</char></note> yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v"/>Musey bazzo biittan biraata shooshi kaqqidayssada tana ammanida ubbay merinaa de7uwa ekkana mela Asa Na7ay dhoqqu gaanaw bessees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:9">Tay 21:9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Xoossaa Na7aa ammaniyaa ubbay merinaa de7uwa laattanaappe attin dhayonna mela Xoossay ha alamiya daro dosida gisho ba issi Na7aa immis. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Xoossay ba Na7aa ha alamiya kiittiday alamiya pirddanaw gidonnashin alamiya iya baggara ashshanaassa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Na7aa ammaniyaa oonikka pirddettenna, shin Na7aa ammanonna oonikka issi Xoossaa Na7aa ammaniboonna gisho ha77i pirddettis. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pirddayka hayssa: poo7oy alamiya yis, shin asaa oosoy iita gidiya gisho asay poo7uwappe aathidi dhumaa dosees. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Iitabaa oothiya oonikka poo7o ixxees. Ays giikko, ba oosoy qoncconna mela poo7uwakko yeenna. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Shin tuma oothiya oonikka Xoossay kiittidayssada I oothidayssa poo7oy qonccisana mela poo7uwakko yees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusanne Xammaqiya Yohaannisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusinne iya tamaareti Yihuda biitta bidosona. Yesuusi yan xammaqishe enttara guutha wode uttis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Qassi Yohaannisi Saleeme matan de7iya Henoona giyason gidiya haathi de7iya gisho asaa yan xammaqees. Asaykka yaa bidi xammaqettosona. <verse number="24" style="v"/>He wode Yohaannisi buroo qashettibeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Maato 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mar 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luuqa 3:19-20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yohaannisa tamaaretinne issi Ayhude addey <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Issi Ayhude Addey: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Issi issi maxaafati “Guutha Ayhude asati” yaagosona.</char></note> geesho wogabaa palamidosona. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Entti Yohaannisakko bidi, “Asttamaariyaw, Yorddaanose Shaafappe hefinthan neera de7eyssi, neeni iyabaa markkattidayssi, hekko xammaqees. Asay ubbayka iyaakko boosona” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yohaannisi zaaridi, “Xoossay immonna asi aybibaakka ekkanaw dandda7enna. <verse number="28" style="v"/>‘Taani Kiristtoosa gidikke, shin iyappe sinthe kiitetas’ gidayssas taw hinttee, hintte huu7en markka.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Yoha 1:20</ref></char></note> <verse number="29" style="v"/>Gelos giigidaara ekkenaw giigidayssassa. Ekkeyssa laggey iya matan eqqidi I geyssa si7iya wode daro ufayttees. Hessa gisho, hayssi ta ufayssay polettis. <verse number="30" style="v"/>I gitatanaw taani guuxanaw bessees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Bollafe yeyssi ubbaafe bolla. Sa7appe benttidayssi sa7abaa. I sa7abaa odees. Saloppe yeyssi ubbaafe bolla. <verse number="32" style="v"/>I ba be7idabaanne si7idabaa markkattees, shin iya markkatethaa ekkey baawa. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Iya markkatethaa ekkiya oonikka Xoossay tuma gideyssa qonccisees. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Xoossay ba geeshsha Ayyaana iyaw kumethi immiya gisho Xoossay kiittidayssi Xoossaa qaala odees. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Aaway ba Na7aa dosidi ubbabaa iya kushen wothis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Maato 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:22">Luuqa 10:22</ref></char></note> <verse number="36" style="v"/>Na7aa ammaniyaa uraas merinaa de7oy de7ees. Shin Na7aa ammanonnayssa bolla Xoossaa hanqoy de7eesippe attin I de7o demmenna.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusanne Samaare maccasiw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesuusi Yohaannisayssafe dariya kaalleyssata baakko shiisheyssanne xammaqeyssa Farisaaweti si7idosona. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Gidikkoka Yesuusa tamaareti xammaqidosonappe attin Yesuusi oonakka xammaqibeena. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesuusi asay iyabaa geyssa si7ida wode Yihudappe denddidi Galiila bis. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Galiila bishe Samaarera aadhdhanayssi iyaw attonnabaa gidis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Yayqoobi ba na7aa Yoosefas immida gadiya matan de7iya Sikaare giya Samaare katamaa bis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 33:19">Medhe 33:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Iya 24:32</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v"/>He bessan Yayqooba haathaa ollay de7ees. Yesuusi hamuthan daaburidi he haathaa olla matan uttis. He wode sa7ay usuppun saate heera.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Issi Samaare katamaa maccas he ollaafe haathe tikkanaw yasu. Yesuusi he maccaseekko, “Tana haathe ushsharkkii” yaagis. <verse number="8" style="v"/>He wode Yesuusa tamaareti kathi shammanaw katama bidosonashin.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>He maccasiya zaarada, “Neeni Ayhude ase gidashe, Samaare maccas gidiya tana waanada haathe ushsha gay?” yaagasu. Hessa iya giday Ayhudeti Samaaretara gayttonna gishossa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:1-5">Iz 4:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 4:1-2">Nah 4:1-2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Neeni Xoossaa imotaanne haathe tana ushsha geyssi ooneekko eridabaa gidiyakko iya ne woossana; ikka new de7o immiya haathi immanashin” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Maccasiya zaarada, “Godaw, new duuqqiyabay baawa; ollayka ziqqa. Yaatin, de7o immiya haathi ne awuppe ekkanee? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nuus ha haathaa olla immida nu aawa Yayqoobappe neeni aadhdhay? I, iya naytinne iya mehey ha ollaafe uyidosona” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Ha haathaafe uyida oonikka zaari saamottana. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Shin taani immana haathaa uyaa oonikka ubbakka saamottenna. Taani immana haathay iya giddon merinaa de7o immiya goggiya pultto gidana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Maccasiya zaarada, “Godaw, taani saamottonna melanne haathe tikkanaw ha bessaa yoonna mela taw he haathaa imma” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesuusi iikko, “Bada ne azina xeegada ya” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Maccasiya zaarada, “Taw azini baawa” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi iikko, “Taw azini baawa guussan balabaakka. <verse number="18" style="v"/>New kase ichchashu azinati de7oosona. Ha77i neera de7iya addey ne azina gidenna. Neeni ha77i tuma odadasa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Maccasiya zaarada, “Godaw, neeni nabe gideyssa taani eras. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nu aawati ha deriya bolla Xoossaa goynnidosona. Shin hintte Ayhudeti asi Xoossas goynnanaw bessiya bessay Yerusalaamena geeta” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Ha maccasete tana ammana; ha deriya bolla woykko Yerusalaamen Aawas hintte goynnona wodey yaana. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hintte Samaareti eronnayssa goynneeta. Shin nuuni atotethay Ayhudeppe yaa gisho nu ereyssa goynnos. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Shin Aawas tuman goynneyssati Ayyaananinne tumatethan goynnana wodey matattis; ha77ika gakkis. Hiza, Aaway koyey hayssa mela ogiyan goynneyssata. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Xoossay Ayyaana; iyaw goynneyssati Ayyaananinne tumatethan goynnanaw bessees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Maccasiya zaarada, “Kiristtoosi yaanayssa taani erays. I yaa wode nuus ubbabaa odana” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Ha neera odettey taani iya” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Entti odettishin, Yesuusa tamaareti bida bessaafe simmidosona. Yesuusi maccasara odettishin entti be7idi daro malaalettidosona. Shin maccaseekko, “Ay koyay?” giday woykko Yesuusakko, “Iira ays odettay?” giday oonikka baawa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, maccasiya ba haatha otuwa aggada guye katamaa bada asaakko, <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Taani oothidabaa ubbaa taw odida addiya be7anaw yedhdhite. I Kiristtoosa gidanddeshshaa?” yaagasu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Asay katamaappe keyidi Yesuusakko bidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hessi hanishin, iya tamaareti Yesuusakko, “Guuthabaa markkii” yaagidi woossidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Shin I, “Taw hintte eronna kathi ta meyssi de7ees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, iya tamaareti bantta giddon, “Iyaw miyabaa asi ehonna aggenna?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako, “Ta kathay tana kiittidayssa sheniya oothanayssanne iya oosuwa polanayssa. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Hintte, ‘Oyddu ageenappe guye kathay cakettana’ geekketiyye? Shin taani hinttew odays; kathay kaxidi shiishoos gakkidayssa loythi xeellite. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Zereyssinne cakkeyssi issife ufayttana mela cakkeyssi damooziya ekkees qassi kathaa merinaa de7os shiishees. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Hiza, ‘Issoy zerees; hankkoy qassi cakkees’ giya oday tuma. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Hintte daaburiboonayssa shiishana mela taani hinttena kiittas. Harati oothi daaburidasuwan gelidi hintte entta daaburaa ayfiyaa ekkideta” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Maccasiya, “I, taani oothida ubbabaa odis” gada markkattida gisho he kataman de7iya Samaare asaappe daroti Yesuusa ammanidosona. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Samaare asay Yesuusakko yidi, bantta matan gam77ana mela Yesuusa woossin I yan nam77u gallas uttis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>I odiya qaala gisho kaseyssafe daro asay ammanidosona. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Qassi entti maccaseekko, “Ha77i nu ammaney nu huu7en I geyssa si7ida gishossafe attin neeni markkattida gishossa gidenna. Qassi I tuma ha alamiya ashsheyssa gideyssa nuuni erida” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi issi shuumaa na7aa pathis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Nam77u gallasappe guye, Yesuusi yaappe keyidi Galiila biitta bis. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Yesuusi ba huu7en, “Nabey ba biittan bonchchettena” yaagidi kasetidi odis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:57">Maato 13:57</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:4">Mar 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:24">Luuqa 4:24</ref></char></note> <verse number="45" style="v"/>Yesuusi Galiila gakkida wode Galiila asay iya mokkidosona. Ays giikko, Faasika Baale bonchchiya gallas entti Yerusalaamen de7iya gisho I oothidabaa ubbaa be7idosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:23">Yoha 2:23</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesuusi haathaa woyne ushshi laammida bessaa, Galiilan de7iya Qaana katama bis. Qifirnahoomen kawo keethan oothiya issi shuumaas na7ay harggettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:1-11">Yoha 2:1-11</ref></char></note> <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yesuusi Yihudappe Galiila yidayssa he shuumay si7idi iyaakko yis. Hayqqanaw matida ba na7aa bidi pathana mela Yesuusa woossis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesuusi shuumakko, “Xoossay oothiya malaatatanne oorathabata be7onna de7ishe hintte ubbarakka ammanekketa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Shuumay zaaridi, “Godaw, ta na7ay hayqqonna de7ishin taara yedhdharkki” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Ne soo ba; ne na7ay paxana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">He shuumay Yesuusi gidayssa ammanidi ba soo bis. <verse number="51" style="v"/>I ba soo bishin iya aylleti iyaakko yishe iyara ogen gayttidi, “Ne na7ay paxis” gidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>I ba aylleta ba na7aas ay saaten lo77idaakko oychchis. Entti zaaridi, “Zine laappun saaten mishay aggis” yaagidosona. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Na7aa aaway Yesuusi baakko, “Ne na7ay paxana” giday he saatiyan gideyssa akeekis. Hessa gisho, inne iya soo asay ubbay ammanidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Hessi Yesuusi Yihudappe Galiila yidi oothida nam77antho malaataa.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi issi gundda addiya pathis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi Ayhudeti bonchchiya baaliyas Yerusalaame bis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yerusalaamen Dorssa Penggiya matan Ibraysxe doonan Beetesayda giya teqeti uttida haathay de7ees. He teqeti uttida haathaa matan ichchashu shemppiya bessati de7oosona. <verse number="3" style="v"/>[Hessan haathay qaaxxanayssa naagiya] daro hargganchchoti, qooqeti, wobbetinne gunddati zin77idosona. <verse number="4" style="v"/>[Ays giikko, issi issi toho Godaa kiitanchchoy teqettida haathan wodhdhidi haathaa qaathees. Haathay qaaxxiya wode koyro gelida uray bana oykkida ay harggefekka paxees.] <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Issi issi beni maxaafati paydo heedzas koyro baggaanne paydo oydda gujjokona.</char></note> <verse number="5" style="v"/>He bessan hasttamanne hosppun laythi harggettida issi addey de7ees. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesuusi yan zin77ida addiya be7idi, qassi daro wode harggettidayssa eridi addiyako, “Paxanaw koyay?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hargganchoy zaaridi, “Godaw, haathay qaaxxiya wode tana haathan yeggiya asi baawa. Taani gelana haniya wode haray taappe sinthattidi geli kichchees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesuusi iyaakko, “Dendda eqqa; ne alggaa tookkada ba” yaagis. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Addey sohuwarakka paxis; ba alggaa tookkidi bis.</para>
  <para style="p">Hessi Sambbaata gallasan hanis. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Ayhudeti paxida addiyako, “Hachchi sa7ay Sambbaata; neeni ne alggaa tookkeyssi woga gidenna” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:19">Nah 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:21">Er 17:21</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Shin addey, “Tana pathidayssi, ne alggaa tookkada ba gis” yaagidi zaaris.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Entti iyaakko, “Nena, ne alggaa tookkada ba giday I oonee?” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi he bessan daro asaa giddora erisonna kanthidi bida gisho addey bana pathiday ooneekko erenna. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesuusi guyeppe he addiya Xoossa Keethan demmidi, “Hekko, neeni paxadasa; hayssafe iitabay nena gakkonna mela zaarada nagara oothofa” yaagis. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, addey bidi bana pathidayssi Yesuusa gididayssa Ayhudetas odis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesuusi hessa Sambbaata gallas oothida gisho, Ayhudeti Yesuusa gooda oykkidosona. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Ta Aaway ubba wode oothees; takka oothanaw bessees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesuusi Sambbaata bonchchonna gisho xalaalas gidonnashin Xoossay ba Aawa gidi bana Xoossara giigisida gisho, Ayhudeti iya wodhanaw kaseyssafe minthidi koyidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Xoossaa Na7aa maata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani hinttew tuma odays; Na7ay barkka aykkoka oothanaw dandda7enna. I ba Aaway oothishin be7oyssa xalaala oothees. Aaway ootheyssa Na7aykka oothees. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Aaway ba Na7aa dosiya gisho I oothiya ooso ubbaa ba Na7aa bessees. Hintte malaalettana mela I hayssafe aadhdhiya ooso ba Na7aa bessana. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Aaway hayqqidayssata hayqoppe denthidi enttaw de7o immeyssada Na7aykka ba koyeyssatas de7o immees. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Aaway Na7aas pirdda maata ubbaa immisppe attin I oonakka pirddenna. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Asay ubbay Aawa bonchcheyssada Na7aakka bonchchana. Na7aa bonchchonna oonikka Na7aa kiittida Aawakka bonchchenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Taani hinttew tuma odays; ta qaala si7eyssasinne tana kiittidayssa ammaneyssas merinaa de7oy de7ees. I hayqoppe de7on pinnida gisho pirddettenna. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Taani hinttew tuma odays; hayqqida asay Xoossaa Na7aa qaala si7iya wodey yaana; hessika ha77i. He qaalay si7ey de7on daana. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Aaway de7os pultto gididayssada Na7aakka de7os pultto oothis. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Na7ay Asa Na7a gidiya gisho Aaway Na7aas pirdda maata immis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Duufon de7eyssati iya qaala si7idi denddiya wodey yaana gisho hayssan malaalettofite. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lo77o oothidayssati de7on daanaw qassi iita oothidayssati pirdda ekkanaw duufoppe denddana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Daane 12:2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusas markkattida asata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>“Taani ta maatan aybibaakka oothanaw dandda7ikke. Xoossay taw odidayssada pirddays. Taani tana kiittidayssi koyabaa oothaysippe attin ta koyabaa oothonna gisho ta pirdday tuma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Taani tabaa markkatiko ta markkatethay tuma gidenna. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Tabaa markkattiya hari de7ees; I tabaa markkatteyssi tuma gideyssa taani erays.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Hintte Yohaannisakko ase kiittin I tumaas markkattis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:19-27">Yoha 1:19-27</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 3:27-30">3:27-30</ref></char></note> <verse number="34" style="v"/>Taani hessa hinttew odey, hintte attana mela gadappe attin asa markkatethi taw koshshin gidenna. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yohaannisi muqaadada eexishe poo7is. Hintte guutha wode iya poo7uwan ufayttideta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>“Shin taw Yohaannisappe aadhdhiya markki de7ees. Taani oothana mela ta Aaway taw immida oosoti tabaa markkattosona; Aaway tana kiittidayssa qonccisoosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Qassi tana kiittida Aawaykka ba huu7en tabaa markkattees. Hintte iya qaala ubbarakka si7ibeekketa woykko iya malaa be7ibeekketa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Maato 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luuqa 3:22</ref></char></note> <verse number="38" style="v"/>I kiittidayssa hintte ammanonna gisho iya qaalay hintte wozanan baawa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>“Geeshsha Maxaafatappe merinaa de7o demmanabaa hinttew daanin entta pilggeeta; entti tabaa markkattosona. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Shin hintte de7o demmanaw taakko yaanaw koyekketa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Asappe taani bonchcho koyikke. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Shin taani hintte wozanan Xoossaa siiqoy baynnayssa erays. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Taani ta Aawa maatan yas, shin tana mokkibeekketa. Haray ba maatan yaa wode iya mokkeeta. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Hintte issoy issuwafe bonchcho koyeyssati, issi Xoossafe yaa galata ekkanaw koyonnayssati, waanidi tana ammananaw dandda7etii?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>“Taani ta Aawa sinthan hinttena mootiyabaa hinttew daanoppo. Hinttena mootanay hintte ufayssan naagiya Muse. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Hintte Muse ammanidabaa gidiyakko I tabaa xaafida gisho tanakka ammananashin. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Shin hintte I xaafidayssa ammanonna ixxiko ta qaala waattidi ammananee?” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi ichchashu mukulu asaa muzis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Maato 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luuqa 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi Xibaaryoosa giya Galiila Abbaafe hefinthi pinnis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>I hargganchchota pason oothida malaata be7ida gisho, daro asay iya kaallidosona. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesuusi deriya bolla keyidi, yan ba tamaaretara issife uttis. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ayhudeti bonchchiya Faasika Baale gallasay gakkis. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesuusi daro asay baakko yeyssa be7idi Filiphphoosakko, “Ha asaa ubbaa muzanaw gidiya kathi awuppe shammanee?” yaagis. <verse number="6" style="v"/>I hessa Filiphphoosa paaccanaw gisippe attin I ba huu7en ay oothaneekko erees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Filiphphoosi zaaridi Yesuusakko, “Hari attoshin, Huu7en huu7en, issi issi barssi gathanaw, nam77u xeetu dinaaren <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">dinaare: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Issi dinaarey issi asi issi gallas oothi pee7idi ekkiya miishe. Nam77u xeetu dinaarey issi asi laytha bagga oothidi ekkiya miishe keena. (Maato 20:2) xeellite.</char></note> uythu shamminkka gidenna” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Qassi Yesuusa tamaaretappe issoy, Simoon Phexiroosa ishay Inddiriyasi, <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Ichchashu bangga soollonne nam77u molo oykkida issi na7ay hayssan de7ees, shin ha asa ubbaas hessi ay maaddanee?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesuusi ba tamaaretakko, “Asaa utisite” yaagis. He bessan daro maati de7ees; asay ubbay uttis. Adde asaa tayboy ichchashu mukulu gidana. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesuusi uythaa ekkidi Xoossaa galati simmidi yan uttida asaas gishis. Moluwakka ekkidi hessada oothidi immin, asay ba koyidayssa mela mis. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Entti ubbay kallidaappe guye, Yesuusi ba tamaaretakko, “Issibaykka iitonna mela attida tiifiya shiishite” yaagis. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, entti ubbaa shiishidosona. Asay min attida bangga soollo tiifiya shiishidi tammanne nam77u gayta kunthidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Asay Yesuusi oothida malaatata be7ida wode, “Hayssi tuma ha alamiya yaana geetettida nabiya” yaagidosona. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesuusi entti iya oykkidi wolqqan kawo oothanaw haneyssa eridi, barkka deriya bolla zaari keyis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi abbaa bollara hamuttis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Maato 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mar 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Sa7ay omarssida wode Yesuusa tamaareti abbaako wodhdhidosona. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Sa7ay qammida gishonne Yesuusi buroo enttako yiboonna gisho iya tamaareti wogolon gelidi abbaa pinnidi Qifirnahoome baanaw denddidosona. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Wolqqaama carkkoy carkkida gisho abbay qaaxxees. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ichchashu woykko usuppun kilo mitire gideyssa mela entti abbaa pidhidi bidaappe guye, Yesuusi abbaa bollara hamuttishe yeyssa be7idi yayyidosona. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Shin I, “Babbofite, tana” yaagis. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Entti ufayttidi iya wogoluwan gelssidosona; iirakka wogoloy entti biya abbaa gaxa gakkis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi de7o uythaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Wonttetha gallas abbaafe hefinthan attida daro asay issi wogolo xalaali de7eyssa be7idosona. Yesuusi ba tamaaretara wogoluwan gelidi, enttara boonnayssanne entti banttarkka bidayssa akeekidosona. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Shin Xibaaryoosappe hara wogoloti Yesuusi Xoossaa galatin, asay uythaa mida bessaa yidosona. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Asay Yesuusi woykko iya tamaareti yan baynnayssa be7idi, Yesuusa koyanaw wogolotan gelidi Qifirnahoome bidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Asay Yesuusa abbaafe hefinthan demmida wode, “Asttamaariyaw, hayssa awude yadi?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani hinttew tuma odays; hintte tana koyey uythi midi kallida gishossafe attin malaata be7ida gishossa gidenna. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Samiya kathas oothofite, shin merinaa de7o immiya kathas oothite. Xoossaa Aaway I oothana mela iyaw maata immida gisho he kathaa Asa Na7ay hinttew immana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yaatin entti, “Nuuni Xoossaa oosuwa oothanaw ay oothanee?” yaagidi Yesuusa oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Hintte oothana mela Xoossay koyaa oosoy hayssa: I kiittidayssa ammanite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Entti zaaridi, “Nuuni be7idi, nena ammanana mela ay malaata ne bessanee? Ne ay oothanee? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Geeshsha Maxaafan, ‘Entti maana mela uythu saloppe immis’ geetetti xaafettidayssada nu aawati bazzo biittan manna midosona” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 6:4">Kessa 6:4</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 6:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24">Maz 78:24</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Taani hinttew tuma odays; hinttew saloppe tuma uythaa immiday ta Aawappe attin Muse gidenna. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hiza, Xoossay immiya uythay saloppe wodhdhidayssi alamiyas de7o immeyssa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Entti zaaridi, “Godaw, nuus he uythaa ubba wode imma” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Taani de7o immiya uythaa; taakko yaa oonikka ubbaraka koshattenna. Qassi tana ammaniyaa uray ubbarakka saamottenna. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Shin taani hinttew odas; hintte tana be7ideta, shin ammanekketa. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Ta Aaway taw immiya ubbay taakko yaana; qassi taakko yaa oonakka kare yeddike. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Taani ta koyabaa oothanaw gidonnashin tana kiittidayssi koyabaa oothanaw saloppe yas. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Tana kiittidayssi koyey hayssa: taani I taw immida ubbatakka wurssetha gallas hayqoppe denthana melappe attin issuwaka dhayssana mela koyenna. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Hiza, ta Aaway koyey hessa: Na7aa be7idi ammaniyaa ubbay merinaa de7uwa ekkana; taani he ubbaa wurssetha gallas merinaa de7os hayqoppe denthana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Taani saloppe wodhdhida uythaa” gida gisho, Ayhudeti iya bolla zuuzummidosona. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Entti, “Hayssi nuuni iya aawanne iya aayiw eriya Yoosefa Na7aa Yesuusa gidennee? Yaatin, I waanidi, ‘Taani saloppe wodhdhas’ gaanaw dandda7ii?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Issoy issuwara zuuzummeyssa aggite. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Tana kiittida ta Aaway taakko ehiya asappe attin taakko yaanaw dandda7iya oonikka baawa. Taani wurssetha gallas iya merinaa de7os hayqoppe denthana. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Nabeti, ‘Xoossay asa ubbaa tamaarssana’ yaagidi xaafidosona. Aawa si7eyssinne iyappe tamaariya oonikka taakko yees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Isa 54:13</ref></char></note> <verse number="46" style="v"/>Xoossaa matappe yidayssafe attin Aawa be7iday oonikka baawa; iya xalaali Aawa be7is.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>“Taani hinttew tuma odays; tana ammaniyaa oodeskka merinaa de7oy de7ees. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Taani de7o immiya uythaa. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Hintte aawati bazzon manna midosona, shin hayqqidosona. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Saloppe yaa uythay hayssa; he uythaa miya oonikka hayqqenna. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Saloppe yida de7o uythay tana. Oonikka ha uythaa miikko merinaw daana. Qassi ha alamey de7on daana mela taani hinttew immana uythay ta ashuwa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Ayhudeti, “Ha addey ba ashuwa nu maana mela nuus waattidi immanaw dandda7ii?” yaagidi bantta giddon palamidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Yesuusi enttako, “Taani hinttew tuma odays; Asa Na7aa ashuwa, hintte moonna ixxiko, qassi iya suuthaa hintte uyonna ixxiko, hinttew de7oy baawa. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Ta ashuwa miya uraasinne ta suuthaa uyaa uraas merinaa de7oy de7ees. Taani wurssetha gallas iya hayqoppe denthana. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Ta ashoy tuma kathi; ta suuthaykka tuma ushshu. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Ta ashuwa miya uraynne ta suuthaa uyaa uray tanan de7ees; takka iyan de7ays. <verse number="57" style="v"/>De7o Aaway tana kiittin, taani iya baggara de7on de7eyssada, tana miya uraykka ta gaason de7on daana. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Saloppe wodhdhida uythay hayssa: hintte aawati midi hayqqida manna mela gidenna; ha uythaa miya uray merinaw daana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Yesuusi Qifirnahoome kataman Ayhude Woosa Keethan hayssa tamaarssis.</para>
  <para style="s">Merinaa de7o qaalaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Yesuusa tamaaretappe dariya baggay hessa si7ida wode, “Hayssi gelonna timirtte; hayssi oodes gelii?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Yesuusi ba tamaareti hessas zuuzummidayssa eridi, “Hayssi hinttena dhubbi? <verse number="62" style="v"/>Yaatin, Asa Na7ay kase de7iyasuwa pude keyishin hintte be7idi woyganddetii? <verse number="63" style="v"/>Geeshsha Ayyaanay de7o immees; asa wolqqi aykkoka maaddenna. Ta hinttew odiya qaalay de7o immiya Geeshsha Ayyaanaappe yees. <verse number="64" style="v"/>Shin hintte giddon ammanonnayssati de7oosona” yaagis. Ammanonnayssati oonanteeko Yesuusi koyroppe doomidi erees. Qassi bana aathi immanay ooneekko erees. <verse number="65" style="v"/>Qassika Yesuusi, “Aaway ba goonna oonikka taakko yaanaw dandda7enna gada taani odiday hessa gishossa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Hessa gaason, Yesuusa kaalleyssatappe daroti iya aggidi guye simmidosona; zaari iya kaallibookkona. <verse number="67" style="v"/>Yesuusi ba tammanne nam77u tamaaretakko, “Hintteka aggidi baanaw koyeetii?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v"/>Simoon Phexiroosi zaaridi, “Godaw, nuuni oodeko baanee? New merinaa de7o immiya qaalay de7ees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:68-69 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:16">Maato 16:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:29">Mar 8:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:20">Luuqa 9:20</ref></char></note> <verse number="69" style="v"/>Neeni Xoossaa Geeshshaa gideyssa nuuni ammanoosinne eroos” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako, “Taani hinttena tammanne nam77ata doorabiikkinaa? Shin hinttefe issoy Xalahe” yaagis. <verse number="71" style="v"/>Yesuusi hessa giday Simoona Na7aa Asqoroota Yihudasa. Yihudi Yesuusa aathi immanaw de7iya tammanne nam77u tamaaretappe issuwa.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusaranne iya ishatara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Ayhudeti Yesuusa wodhanaw koyaa gisho I Yihuda aggidi Galiilan simerettees. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ayhudeti bonchchiya Shaqara Baaley bonchchettanaw matis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:34">Leewe 23:34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:13">Zaare 16:13</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Yesuusa ishati, “Ne tamaareti neeni oothiya malaatata be7ana mela hayssafe denddada Yihuda biittaa ba. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Baw erettanaw koya asi oonikka ba oosuwa genthenna. Neeni hayssata oothada nebaa alamiya erisa” yaagidosona. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Iya ishati hessa giday iyan ammaniboonna gishossa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako, “Taw injje wodey gakkibeenna, shin hinttew ubba wodey injjetees. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Alamey hinttena ixxanaw dandda7enna, shin taani alamiya oosoy iita gideyssa markkattiya gisho tana ixxees. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hintte baaliya biite; ta wodey gakkiboonna gisho taani baaliya biikke” yaagis. <verse number="9" style="v"/>I hessa gidi Galiilan attis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi baaliya bonchchanaw bis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Iya ishati baaliya bonchchanaw bidaappe guye Yesuusi oonakka erisonna qosan he bessaa bis. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ayhudeti baaliya bonchchiya bessan, “I awun de7ii?” yaagidi iya koyidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Asay kalkkashidi iyabaa odettoosona. Baggay, “I lo77o asi” giya wode harati qassi, “Akkay, I asaa balethees” yaagosona. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Shin Ayhude halaqatas yayyida gisho oonikka iyabaa qonccen odettenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Baaliya bonchchidi giddo gathiya wode Yesuusi Xoossa Keethi bidi tamaarsso oykkis. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ayhudeti, “Ha addey timirtte tamaaronna hayssa ubbaa waati eridee?” yaagidi malaalettidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Ta tamaarssiya timirttey tana kiittida Xoossaa matappe yaa timirttefe attin tabaa gidenna. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Xoossaa sheniya oothanaw koyaa oonikka ha timirttey Xoossaa matappe yiyaakkonne woykko taani taappe odiyakko erana. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Babaa odiya oonikka ba huu7e bonchcho koyees. Shin bana kiittidayssa bonchchuwa koyaa oonikka I tumanchcho; iyan worddoy baawa. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Musey hinttew higgiya immis, shin hinttefe oonikka higgiya naagibeenna. Yaatin ays tana wodhanaw koyeetii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Asay zaaridi, “Nena Xalahey oykkis; nena wodhanaw oonee koyey?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Taani issi malaata oothin hintte ubbay malaalettideta. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hinttee, hintte nayta qaxxarana mela Musey kiittis. Shin qaxxaro hintte mayzati doomidosonappe attin Muse gidenna. Hessa gisho, hintte Sambbaata gallas adde nayta qaxxareeta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Leewe 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:10">Medhe 17:10</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v"/>Muse higgey kiittida gisho, hintte Sambbaata gallas qaxxariyabaa gidikko, taani issi asa kumetha asatethaa pathida gisho, taara ays kacceetii?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:9">Yoha 5:9</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v"/>Tuma pirdda pirdditeppe attin asa som77o be7idi pirddofite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi, I Kiristtoosee?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yerusalaame asaappe issoti issoti, “Entti wodhanaw koyaa uray hayssa gidennee? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hekko, i qonccen I odees; entti iya aykkoka gookkona. I Kiristtoosa gideyssa Ayhude halaqati tuma eridonaashsha? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kiristtoosi yaa wode I awuppe yiyaakko oonikka erenna, shin i awuppe yidaakko nu eroos” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesuusi Xoossa Keethan tamaarssishe ba qaala dhoqqu oothidi, “Tuma hintte taani ooneekkonne ta awuppe yidaakko ereetii? Taani ta maatan yabiikke, shin tana kiittidayssi tumanchcho; hintte iya erekketa. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Shin taani I kiittin iya matappe yida gisho iya erays” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, entti iya oykkanaw koyidosona. Shin iya wodey buroo gakkiboonna gisho oonikka iya bolla kushe wothibeenna. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Shin daro asay Yesuusa ammanidi, “Kiristtoosi yaa wode ha uray oothida malaatatappe dariya malaata oothaneeyye?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa oykkanaw wotaaddareti kiitettidosona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Farisaaweti daro asay Yesuusabaa kalkkasheyssa si7idosona. Kahine halaqatinne Farisaaweti iya oythidi qashisanaw Xoossa Keethi naageyssata kiittidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Taani hinttera guutha wode gam77ana; hessafe guye tana kiittidayssako baana. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Hintte tana koyana, shin demmeketa. Taani de7iyasuwa hintte yaanaw dandda7ekketa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Ayhudeti issoy issuwara, “Hayssi nuuni demmonnaso aw baana hanii? Girike kataman de7iya Ayhudetakko bidi Giriketa tamaarssanaw haniyye? <verse number="36" style="v"/>‘Hintte tana koyana, shin demmeketa’ qassi, ‘Taani de7iyasuwa hintte yaanaw dandda7ekketa’ guussay ay guussee?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">De7o haathaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Baaliya bonchchiya gallasatappe wolqqaamanne wurssetha gallasan Yesuusi denddidi, ba qaalaa dhoqqu oothidi, “Saamottida oonikka taakko yidi uyo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:36">Leewe 23:36</ref></char></note> <verse number="38" style="v"/>Tana ammaniyaa oonikka Geeshsha Maxaafay gidayssada de7o immiya pultto haathay iyappe goggana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 47:1">Hiz 47:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:8">Zakka 14:8</ref></char></note> <verse number="39" style="v"/>I hessa giday iya ammanidayssati ekkanaw de7iya Geeshsha Ayyaanabaa. Yesuusi buroo bonchchettiboonna gisho, he wode Geeshsha Ayyaanay imettibeenna.</para>
  <para style="s">Asaa giddon shaaketethi medhettis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>He asaappe daroti I geyssa si7idi, “Tuma hayssi nabiya” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:40 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nabiya: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ha bessan nabiya geetettiday yaana gidi entti naagiya nabiya qonccisees. (Yoha 1:21 xeellite.)</char></note> yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Harati qassi, “Hayssi Kiristtoosa” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">Shin harati qassi, “Kiristtoosi Galiilappe waanidi keyi? <verse number="42" style="v"/>Geeshsha Maxaafay, ‘Kiristtoosi Dawite sheeshaappe Dawitey de7ida Beeteleme katamaappe yaana’ yaagenneyye?” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2Saamu 7:12</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mik 5:2</ref></char></note> <verse number="43" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Yesuusa gaason asay bantta giddon shaakettidosona. <verse number="44" style="v"/>He asaappe issoti issoti iya oykkanaw koyidosona, shin oonikka iya bolla kushe wothibeenna.</para>
  <para style="s">Ayhude halaqati ammanibookkona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Xoossa Keetha naageyssati kahine halaqatakkonne Farisaawetakko guye simmi yin entti, “Ays iya ehibeekketii?” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Xoossa Keetha naageyssati enttako, “Ha addey odetteyssatho oonikka odettenna” yaagidi zaaridosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Farisaaweti zaaridi, “I hinttenakka balethidee? <verse number="48" style="v"/>Ayhude halaqatappe woykko Farisaaweteppe iya ammanida asi de7ii? <verse number="49" style="v"/>Muse higgiya eronna ha asay qanggettidabaa” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Farisaawetappe issoy qamma Yesuusakko bida Niqodimoosi enttako,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:1">Yoha 3:1</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 3:2">2</ref></char></note> <verse number="51" style="v"/>“Issi asi giyabaa si7onna woykko I ay oothidaakko eronna de7ishe koyrottidi iya bolla pirddeyssi nu higgiyan de7ii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Entti zaaridi, “Neenikka qassi Galiila biitta ase? Galiila biittaafe nabey keyonnayssa Geeshsha Maxaafaappe pilggada demma” yaagidosona.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Laymatethan oykettida maccasiw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Issoy issoy aggidi ba soo ba soo bis, shin Yesuusi Shamaho Deriya bolla bis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Qassi wonttetha gallas guura Xoossa Keethi simmis. Daro asay iyaakko yin uttidi entta tamaarssis. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Higge asttamaaretinne Farisaaweti laymatishin oykkida issi maccasiw iyaakko ehidosona. Entti asa ubbaa sinthan iyo essidi, <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Asttamaariyaw, ha maccasiya laymatishin nu oykkida. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Muse higgey hanni mela maccas shuchchan cadeetta hayqqana mela kiittees. Yaatin, neeni woygay?” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Leewe 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:22-24">Zaare 22:22-24</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Entti hessa giday Yesuusa paaccidi iya mootiyabaa demmanaasa. Shin Yesuusi hokkidi ba biradhdhen biitta bolla xaafis. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Entti iya zaari zaari oychchidi aggonna ixxin, pude dhoqqu gidi, “Hintte giddon nagara oothiboonna asi koyrottidi iyo shuchchan caddo” yaagis. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Qassika hokkidi biitta bolla xaafis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Entti hessa si7ida wode cimatappe doomidi issoy issoy keyishe wuridosona. Yesuusa xalaali he bessan eqqida maccaseera attis. <verse number="10" style="v"/>I pude dhoqqu gidi maccaseekko, “Maccasete, asati aw bidonaa? Ne bolla pirddiday oonikka baawee?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Maccasiya, “Godaw, oonikka baawa” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taanikka ne bolla pirddike. Ba; zaarada nagara oothofa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi alamiyas poo7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Qassika Yesuusi asaakko, “Taani alamiyas poo7o. Tana kaalliya oonikka de7o immiya poo7uwa ekkanaappe attin dhuman simerettena” yaagidi odis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:14">Maato 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:5">Yoha 9:5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Farisaaweti, “Ne nebaa markkattasa, shin ne markkatethay tuma gidenna” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:31">Yoha 5:31</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani tabaa markkattikokka ta markkatethay tuma. Ays giikko, taani awuppe yidaakko qassi aw biyakko erays, shin hintte erekketa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hintte asa qofan pirddeeta; taani issi asa bollaka pirddike. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Taani pirddiyabaa gidikkoka ta pirdday tuma. Ays giikko, tana kiittida ta Aaway taara de7eesippe attin taani tarkka de7ikke. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nam77u asa markkatethi tuma gideyssi hintte higgiyan xaafettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Zaare 19:15</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v"/>Taani tabaa ta huu7en markkattays; qassi tana kiittida ta Aawaykka tabaa markkattees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Entti, “Ne aaway awun de7ii?” yaagidi iya oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi zaaridi, “Hintte tana woykko ta Aawa erekketa. Tana eridabaa gidiyakko, hintte ta Aawakka eranashin” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesuusi Xoossa Keethan muxaata miishiya yeggiya saaxiney de7iya bessan hessa tamaarssis. Iya qammay buroo gakkiboonna gisho oonikka iya oykkibeenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Qassika Yesuusi enttako, “Taani baana; hintte tana koyana, shin hintte atotethi demmonna hintte nagaran hayqqana. Taani biyasuwa baanaw hintte dandda7ekketa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ayhude halaqati, “I, ‘Taani biyasuwa hintte baanaw dandda7ekketa’ yaagees. I bana barkka wodhaneyye?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Hintte garssafe; taani bollafe. Hintte ha alamiyappe, taani ha alamiyappe gidikke. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hintte atotethi demmonna hintte nagaran hayqqana gada taani hinttew odiday hessassa. <char style="nd">Taani Tana Gideyssa </char> hintte ammanonna ixxiko hintte atotethi demmonna hintte nagaran hayqqana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Entti, “Neeni oonee?” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani, koyroppe hinttew odida tana. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Taani hinttebaa odada pirddiyabay darobay de7ees. Shin tana kiittidayssi tumanchcho; qassi taani iyappe si7idayssa xalaala alamiyas odays” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesuusi ba Aawabaa odeyssa entti akeekibookkona. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Yesuusi enttako, “Hintte Asa Na7aa pude dhoqqu oothiya wode <char style="nd">Taani Tana Gideyysa</char> hintte erana. Qassika taani ta maatan aykkoka oothonayssanne ta Aaway tana tamaarssidayssa odeyssa hintte erana. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Tana kiittidayssi taara de7ees. Taani ubba wode iya ufayssiyabaa oothiya gisho I tana ta xalaala aggibeenna” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesuusi hessa odishin si7ida daro asay iya ammanidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Nagara aylletethafe kessi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesuusi bana ammanida asatakko, “Hintte ta timirttiyas kiitettiko tuma tana kaalleyssata. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hintte tumaa erana; tumaykka hinttena aylletethafe kessana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Entti zaaridi, “Nuuni Abrahaame sheeshi; nuuni oodeskka aylletibookko. Neeni woygada, ‘Hintte aylletethafe keyana’ gay?” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:9">Maato 3:9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:8">Luuqa 3:8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani hinttew tuma odays; nagara oothiya oonikka nagara aylle. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Aylley merinaw soo asaara deenna, shin na7ay merinaw soo asaara de7ees. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Na7ay hinttena aylletethafe kessiko hintte aylletethafe tuma keyana. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Hintte Abrahaame sheeshi gideyssa taani erays. Shin ta qaalay hintte wozanan baynna gisho, tana wodhanaw koyeeta. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Taani ta Aaway tana bessidayssa odays, shin hintteka hintte aawappe si7idayssa ootheeta” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Entti zaaridi, “Nu aaway Abrahaame” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi enttako, “Hintte Abrahaame nayta gidiyakko I oothidayssa oothana. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Shin Xoossafe si7ida tumaa odida tana hintte wodhanaw koyeeta. Abrahamey hessada oothibeenna. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Hinttee, hintte aaway oothidayssa ootheeta” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Entti zaaridi, “Nuuni tuma Xoossaa nayta; nuus issi Aaway Xoossaa xalaali de7ees” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako, “Xoossay tuma hintte aawa gidiyakko hintte tana dosana; ays giikko, taani Xoossaa matappe yada hayssan de7ays. Tana I kiittisppe attin taani ta maatan yabiikke. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Taani geyssa hintte si7anaw koyonna gisho ta giyabay hinttew gelenna. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Hinttee, hintte aawa Xalahe nayta. Qassi hinttee, hintte aaway amottiyabaa oothanaw koyeeta. I koyroppe doomidi shemppo wodheyssa. Tumi iyan baynna gisho I tumaa ixxees. Worddoy iyaw medho gidida gishonne I worddo aawa gidiya gisho worddo odettishe baappe odettees. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Taani tuma haasayays, shin hintte tana ammanekketa. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Hinttefe, ‘Neeni nagara oothishin ta be7as’ gaanaw dandda7ey oonee? Taani tuma odettiyabaa gidikko tana ays ammanekketii? <verse number="47" style="v"/>Xoossaa asi Xoossay giyabaa si7ees. Hintte Xoossaa asi gidonna gisho Xoossay giyabaa si7ekketa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Abrahameppe sinthe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Ayhudeti zaaridi, “ ‘Neeni Samaare asi; nenan tuna ayyaanay de7ees’ gishe likke gidokko?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako “Ta bolla tuna ayyaani baawa. Taani ta Aawa bonchchays, shin hintte tana kawushsheta. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Taani ta huu7e bonchcho koyikke; taani bonchchettana mela koyeysinne taw pirddeyssi de7ees. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Taani hinttew tuma odays; ta qaala naagiya oonikka hayqqenna” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Ayhudeti zaaridi, “Ne bolla tuna ayyaanay de7eyssa nuuni ha77i erida. Abrahamey hayqqis; nabetikka hayqqidosona. Shin neeni, ‘Ta qaalaa naagiya oonikka hayqqenna’ yaagasa. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Neeni hayqqida nu aawa Abrahameppe aadhdhayye? Nabetikka qassi hayqqidosona. Neeni nena oona gada qoppay?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Taani tana bonchchiko ta bonchchoy hada. Hintte, ‘Nu Xoossaa’ giya ta Aaway I tana bonchchees. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Hintte iya eronna ixxiko taani iya erays. Taani iya erikke giikko hintte mela worddotays. Shin taani iya erays; qassi iya qaalaakka naagays. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Hintte aaway Abrahamey ta yuussaa gallasa be7idi ufayttanaw amottis; be7idikka ufayttis” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Ayhudeti zaaridi, “Hari attoshin, new ishatamu laythi kumibeennashin waanada Abrahaame be7as gay?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako, “Taani hinttew tuma odays; Abrahamey yelettanaappe kase <char style="nd">Taani Tana</char>” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, entti Yesuusa caddanaw shuchchi ekkidosona. Shin Yesuusi enttafe geemmidi Xoossa Keethafe keyidi bis.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi qooqe gididi yelettida addiya pathis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesuusi bishe yelettoosappe qooqe gididi de7iya issi addiya be7is. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Iya tamaareti, “Asttamaariyaw, ha addey qooqe gididi yelettana mela nagara oothiday oonee? I oothideyye woykko iya yelidayssati oothidonaa?” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Xoossaa oosoy iya bolla qonccana melappe attin I woykko iya yelidayssati nagara oothida gisho gidenna. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Sa7i gallas de7ishin tana kiittidayssa oosuwa nu oothanaw bessees. Oonikka oothanaw dandda7onna qammay yees. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Taani alamiyan de7ashe alamiyas poo7o” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:14">Maato 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:12">Yoha 8:12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesuusi hessa gidi sa7an cuttis. Ba cuchchan guutha biitta laakothidi he urqqan qooqe addiya ayfiyaa tiyis. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yaatidi, “Bada Salihoome (Salihoome guussay Kiitettidayssa guussu) giya teqettida haathan ne ayfiyaa meecetta” yaagis. Hessa gisho, addey bidi ba ayfiyaa meecettidi xeellishe simmis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Addiya shoorotinne addey kase woossishin be7ida asay, “Hayssi uttidi woossiya addiya gidenneyye?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Issi issi asay, “Hayssi iya” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">Harati qassi, “Akkay, hayssi iya daaneesippe attin iya gidenna” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">Shin addey, “Ee, tana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Entti iyaakko, “Yaatin ne ayfey waanidi xeellide?” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>I zaaridi, “Yesuusa giya addey guutha urqqa laakothidi ta ayfiyaa tiyidi, ‘Salihoome bada ne ayfiyaa meecetta’ yaagin, taani bada meecettada xeella aggas” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Entti iyaakko, “I awun de7ii?” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">Addey, “Taani erikke” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Farisaaweti hanidabaa eranaw koyidosona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Entti kase qooqe, shin ha77i xeellida addiya Farisaawetakko efidosona. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesuusi urqqa laakothidi addiya ayfiyaa pathida gallasay Sambbaata gallas. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, addey waanidi xeellidaakko Farisaaweti iya zaari oychchidosona. Addey enttako, “I ta ayfiyaan guutha urqqa tiyis. Ta ayfiyaa meecettada ha77i xeellays” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Farisaaweteppe issoti issoti, “Hayssa oothida addey Sambbaata higgiya naagonna gisho Xoossaa matappe yibeenna” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">Shin harati, “Nagaranchcho asi hayssa mela malaata waati oothanaw dandda7ii?” yaagidi bantta giddon shaakettidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Farisaaweti addiyako, “I ne ayfiyaa xeelisida gisho ne iyabaa woygay?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">Addey, “I nabe” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ayhude halaqati, iya aayiwunne aawa xeegidi oychchana gakkanaw, addey kase qooqe gididayssanne ha77i I xeelleyssa ammanibookkona. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Entti iya aayiwunne iya aawakko, “Hintte ‘Qooqe gididi yelettis’ giya hintte na7ay hayssee? Yaatin, ha77i waanidi xeellide?” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Iya yelidayssati, “Hayssi nu na7aa gididayssanne qooqe gididi I yelettidayssa nu eroos. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Shin ha77i I waanidi xeellidaakko qassi iya ayfiyaa ooni pathidaakko nuuni erokko. Iya oychchite. I bana erida asi gidiya gisho babaa odanaw dandda7ees” yaagidosona. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Iya yelidayssati hessa giday Ayhudetas yayyida gishossa. Ays giikko, Ayhudeti, Yesuusi I Kiristtoosa yaagidi markkattiya asi de7ikko he uraa Ayhude Woosa Keethafe hilanaw koyrottidi zore qachchidosona. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Iya yelidayssati, “I bana erida asi; iya oychchite” yaagiday hessassa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, qooqe gididi yelettida addiya entti zaari xeegidi, “Tumaa odanaw Xoossan caaqqa; ha addey nagaranchcho gideyssa nu eroos” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Addey zaaridi, “I nagaranchcho gidin, gidonna ixxin ta erikke. Taani qooqe gideyssanne ha77i xeelleyssa he issibaa erays” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Entti zaaridi, “I new ay oothidee? I ne ayfiyaa waati pathidee?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>I enttako, “Taani hinttew odas, shin si7ibeekketa. Ays zaari si7anaw koyeetii? Hintteka iya tamaare gidanaw koyeetiyye?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Entti iya cayidi, “Ne he uraa tamaare gida; nuuni Muse tamaare. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Xoossay Muses odidayssa nuuni eroos, shin hari attoshin ha uray I awuppe yidaakkoka nu erokko” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Addey enttako, “I awuppe yidaakko hintte eronayssi malaalisiyabaa, shin I ta ayfiyaa pathis. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Xoossaa bonchcheyssanne I koyabaa oothiya uraa Xoossay si7eesippe attin nagaranchchota si7enna. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Saloy sa7i medhettosappe qooqe gididi yelettida asa ayfe pathiday oonikka baawa. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ha addey Xoossafe kiitettiboonnabaa gidiyakko issibaakka oothanaw dandda7enna” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Entti zaaridi, “Neeni nagaran yelettada diccidayssi nuna tamaarssanaw koyay?” yaagidosona. Iya Ayhude Woosa Keethafe hilidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Wozana qooqetethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesuusi entti addiya kessidayssa si7ida wode iya demmidi, “Asa Na7aa ammanay?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Addey Yesuusakko, “Godaw, taani iya ammanana mela I oonee? Taw odarkkii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesuusi addiyako, “Neeni iya be7adasa; ha neera odetteyssi iya” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Addey zaaridi, “Godaw, ammanays” yaagidi Yesuusas goynnis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Qooqeti xeellana melanne xeelleyssati qooqana mela taani pirddanaw ha alamiya yas” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Iyara de7iya guutha Farisaaweti hessa si7idi, “Nu qooqeyye?” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Hintte qooqe gidiyakko hinttew nagara gidenna. Shin ha77i hintte xeellos giya gisho hinttee, hintte nagaran de7eeta” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi lo77o henthanchcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Taani hinttew tuma odays; dorssa girbbe giddo penggera gidonna harasoora geliya oonikka kaysonne pangga. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Shin penggera geleyssi dorssata heemmeyssa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Penggiya naageyssi iyaw penggiya dooyees; dorssatikka iya qaala si7oosona. I ba dorssata entta sunthan sunthan xeegees; entta kaalethidi kare kessees. <verse number="4" style="v"/>I bayssata kare kessidaappe guye entta sinthan hamuttees. Entti iya qaala eriya gisho iya kaalloosona. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hara uraa qaala entti eronna gisho iyappe baqatoosonappe attin iya geedo kaallokona” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="rem">fig 14 fig*</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttaw ha leemisuwa odis, shin I ay gidaakko entti akeekibookkona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Zaaridi Yesuusi enttako, “Taani hinttew tuma odays; taani dorssatas pengge. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Taappe sinthe yida ubbay kaysonne pangga, shin dorssati entti si7ibookkona. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Penggey tana; ta baggara geliya oonikka attana. I ta baggara gelananne keyana; lo77o heemettiya bessi demmana. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kaysoy kaysotanaw, shukkanawunne dhayssanaw yeesippe attin harabaas yeenna. Taani enttaw de7oy daana melanne kumidi palahana mela yas.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Taani lo77o henthanchcho; lo77o henthanchchoy ba dorssata gisho ba shemppuwa aathi immees. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kera heemmiya asi dorssata godanne henthanchcho gidonna gisho suudhumey yaa wode be7idi dorssata aggidi bees. Hessa gisho, suudhumey dorssata oykkidi laallees. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kera heemmeyssi miishes heemmiya gishonne dorssatabay iya qofisonna gisho dorssata aggidi baqatees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v"/>“Taani lo77o henthanchcho. Ta Aaway tana ereyssada taanikka ta Aawa erays. Hessadakka, taani ta dorssata erays; ta dorssatikka tana eroosona. Taani ta dorssata gisho ta shemppuwa aatha immays.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Maato 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:22">Luuqa 10:22</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ha wudiyan baynna hara dorssati taw de7oosona. Taani enttaka ehanaw bessees. Entti ta qaala si7ana; entti issi wude gidana; henthanchchoykka issuwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Taani ta shemppuwa aathada immada zaara ekkiya gisho ta Aaway tana dosees. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ta dosada ta shemppuwa aatha immaysippe attin taappe oonikka ekkenna. Ta ta shemppuwa aatha immanawunne zaara ekkanaw maati taw de7ees. Taani oothana mela ta Aaway tana kiittidayssi hayssa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hessa I gida gisho, Ayhudeta giddon qassika shaaketethi medhettis. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Enttafe dariya baggay, “Iyan tuna ayyaanay de7ees! I gooyees! I giyabaa ays si7eeti?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Harati qassi, “Xalahey oykkida asi hayssada odettenna. Tuna ayyaani qooqe ayfe xeelisanaw dandda7iyye?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Asa Na7aa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yerusalaamen Xoossa Keetha anjjisida gallasata bonchchiya baaley gakkis; he wode sa7ay balggo. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesuusi Xoossa Keethan Solomone baaranddan simerettees. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ayhudeti Yesuusa yuushon shiiqi eqqidi, “Neeni nuna awude gakkanaw sidhera wothanee? Neeni Kiristtoosa gidikko ane nuus geeshshada oda” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi enttako, “Taani hinttew odas; shin tana ammanekketa. Taani ta Aaway taw immida maatan oothiya oosoy tabaa markkattees. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Shin taani hinttew odidayssada hintte ta dorsse gidonna gisho ammanekketa. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ta dorssati ta qaalaa si7oosona. Taani entta erays; enttika tana kaalloosona. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Taani enttaw merinaa de7uwa immays; entti ubbarakka dhayokkona. Oonikka ta kusheppe entta bonqi ekkanaw dandda7enna. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Entta taw immida ta Aaway ubbaafe aadhdhees <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ta Aaway ubbaafe aadhdhees: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Issi issi beni maxaafati, “Ta Aaway taw immida entti ubbaafe aadhdhoosona” yaagosona.</char></note> Oonikka ta Aawa kusheppe entta bonqi ekkanaw dandda7enna. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Tanne ta Aaway issino” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ayhudeti Yesuusa caddanaw qassika shuchchi denthidosona. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako, “Taani oothana mela ta Aaway taw immida daro lo77o oosota hinttena ootha bessas. Hessatappe awussa gisho tana shuchchan caddanaw koyeetii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ayhudeti zaaridi, “Nuuni nena ne lo77o ooso gisho shuchchan caddanaw koyokko. Shin neeni Xoossaa cayaa gishonne ase gidashe ne nena Xoossaa giya gishossa” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Leewe 24:16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Geeshsha Maxaafan Xoossay, ‘Hintte xoossata’ gidayssi xaafettibeenne?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 82:6">Maz 82:6</ref></char></note> <verse number="35" style="v"/>Geeshsha Maxaafay merinaw laamettenna. Xoossay ba qaala immida asata, ‘xoossata’ gidi xeegikko, <verse number="36" style="v"/>Aaway dooridi ha alamiya kiittida tana Xoossaa Na7a waattidi ‘Xoossaa cayaasa’ yaageeti? <verse number="37" style="v"/>Taani ta Aaway ootheyssa oothonna ixxiko tana ammanoppite. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Shin taani oothiyabaa gidikko hintte tana ammanonna ixxikokka, ta Aaway tanan de7eyssanne takka ta Aawan de7eyssa hintte erana mela ta oosuwa ammanite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Qassika entti iya oykkanaw koyidosona, shin I enttafe kessi ekkis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yohaannisi kase xammaqiya bessaa, Yorddaanose Shaafappe hefinthi Yesuusi pinnidi yan de7is.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:28">Yoha 1:28</ref></char></note> <verse number="41" style="v"/>Daro asay Yesuusakko yidi, “Yohaannisi malaata oothibeenna, shin I ha addiyabaa odidabay ubbay tuma” yaagidosona. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yan daro asay Yesuusa ammanidosona.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Alaazara hayquwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Bitaaniya giya gutan Alaazara giya issi addey harggettis. Bitaaney Mayraamanne I michchiya Martta de7iya guta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:38-39">Luuqa 10:38-39</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>He Mayraama Godaa tohuwa shitto tiyada ba binaanan iya tohuwa quchchidaaro. Harggettiday I ishaa Alaazara.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:3">Yoha 12:3</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, michcheti, “Godaw, ne doseyssi harggettis” gidi Yesuusakko kiittidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesuusi hessa si7ida wode, “Ha harggey, Xoossaynne iya Na7ay bonchchettana melappe attin hayqos gathiya hargge gidenna” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesuusi Martta, I michchiwunne Alaazara dosees. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Shin Alaazari harggidayssa Yesuusi si7idi ba de7iya bessan nam77u gallas gam77is. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi ba tamaaretakko, “Zaaridi Yihuda biittaa boos” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Iya tamaareti zaaridi, “Asttamaariyaw, guutha wodeppe kase Ayhudeti nena shuchchan caddidi wodhanaw koyidosona; ha77ika yaa baanee?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Issi gallasan tammanne nam77u saatey de7ees gidenneyye? Gallas hamuttiya asi ha alamiya poo7uwa be7iya gisho dhubettenna. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Shin qamma hamuttiya oonikka poo7oy baynna gisho, dhubettees” yaagis. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesuusi hessa gidaappe guye enttako, “Nu dosiya Alaazari dhiskkis, shin iya denthanaw taani baana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Iya tamaareti zaaridi, “Godaw, I dhiskkidabaa gidikko iyaw lo77ana” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesuusi Alaazari hayqqidayssa odis, shin enttaw coo dhiskko daanis. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Yesuusi geeshshidi enttako, “Alaazari hayqqis. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hintte ammanana mela taani he bessan de7onnayssas hintte gisho ufayttays. Ane yedhdhite; iyaakko boos” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Didimoosa <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Didimoosa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Guussay mentte guussu.</char></note> geetettiya Toomasi ba lagge tamaaretakko, “Asttamaariyara hayqqanaw nukka boos” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi denddonne de7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesuusi gakkiya wode Alaazari moogettin oyddu gallas gidis. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Bitaaney Yerusalaameppe heedzu kilo mitire mela haakkees. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Daro Ayhudeti Marttanne Mayraamo entta ishay hayqqidayssas minthethanaw yidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Martta Yesuusi yidayssa si7ada iya mokkanaw keyasu, shin Mayraama son attasu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Martta Yesuusakko, “Godaw, neeni hayssan de7idabaa gidiyakko ta ishay hayqqennashin. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Shin ha77i gidikkoka neeni woossiyabaa Xoossay new immanayssa taani erays” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Ne ishay hayqoppe denddana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Martta iyaakko, “Wurssetha gallas I hayqoppe denddanayssa erays” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesuusi iikko, “Taani denddonne de7o; tana ammaniya oonikka hayqqikokka de7on daana. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Qassi de7on de7eynne tana ammaniyaa oonikka hayqqenna. Hessa neeni ammanay?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Martta zaarada, “Godaw, ee taani ammanays! Neeni Xoossaa Na7aa, alamiya yaanaw de7iya Kiristtoosa gideyssa taani ammanays” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Martta hessa gidaappe guye, bada ba michchiw geeman xeegada, “Asttamaarey yidi nena koyees” yaagasu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Mayraama hessa si7ida wode ellesa dendda eqqada Yesuusakko basu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>He saaten Yesuusi Marttara gayttida bessan de7ees; buroo gutaa gakkibeenna. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Mayraamo minthethishe iira son de7iya Ayhudeti, iya dendda eqqada ellesada kare keyidayssa be7idi, duufo bada yeekkanaw haniya daanin iyo kaallidi keyidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Mayraama Yesuusi de7iyasuwa bada iya be7ida wode iya tohuwa bolla kunddada, “Godaw, neeni hayssan de7idabaa gidiyakko ta ishay hayqqennashin” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yesuusi Mayraamanne iira de7iya, Ayhudeti yeekkeyssa be7idi, ba wozanan daro seelettidi, <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Awun moogidetii?” yaagidi oychchin, “Godaw, yada be7a” yaagidi zaaridosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesuusi afuxis. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Ayhudeti, “I Alaazara ay mela dosiyakko be7ite” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Shin enttafe issoti issoti, “Hayssi qooqiya xeelisidayssi ha addey hayqqonna mela oothanaw dandda7eneshin?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Alaazara hayqoppe denthis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Qassika Yesuusi seelettidi, Alaazari moogettida duufuwa bis. He duufoy shuchchan gorddettida gonggolo. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Shuchchaa denthite” yaagidi kiittis.</para>
  <para style="p">Martta, “Godaw, I hayqqosappe oyddu gallas gidida gisho, ha77i xinqqana” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesuusi Marttako, “Ne ammaniyabaa gidikko Xoossaa bonchchuwa be7anayssa taani new odabiikkinaa?” yaagis. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Entti shuchcha denthin Yesuusi salo pude xeellidi, “Aawaw, tana ne si7ida gisho nena galatays. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ne ubba wode tana si7eyssa taani erays. Shin hayssan eqqida asay neeni tana kiittidayssa ammanana mela taani entta gisho hayssa gays” yaagis. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesuusi hessa gidaappe guye, ba qaala dhoqqu oothidi, “Alaazara, haa keya!” yaagis. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Hayqqida addey ziidhettida mela kusheynne tohoy shalon qashettidi de7ishin iya ayfey karey goozettida mela duufuwappe keyis. Yesuusi entta, “Birshshite! Bo giite!” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosa bolla maqettidosona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Maato 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luuqa 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Mayraamikko yida Ayhudetappe daroti Yesuusi oothidayssa be7idi iya ammanidosona. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Shin enttafe issoti issoti Farisaawetakko bidi Yesuusi oothidayssa enttaw odidosona. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, kahine halaqatinne Farisaaweti shangguwa shiishidi, “Ha addey daro malaatata oothiya gisho nu ay oothinoo? <verse number="48" style="v"/>Nuuni iya si7i gidi aggiko asay ubbay iya ammanana. Qassi Roome biittaa asati yidi nu Xoossa Keethanne nu deriya dhayssana” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Enttafe issoy Qayyaafa geyssi, he laythi kahine halaqa gididayssi, “Hintte aykkoka erekketa! <verse number="50" style="v"/>Asay ubbay dhayeyssafe asa ubbaa gisho issi asi hayqqeyssi lo77o gideyssa erekketii?” yaagis. <verse number="51" style="v"/>I hessa baappe gibeenna. Shin he laythi kahine halaqa gidiya gisho, Yesuusi Ayhude asaa gisho hayqqanaw besseyssa tinbbite odis. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Qassi Yesuusi Ayhude asaa xalaalas gidonnashin laalettidi de7iya Xoossaa asa ubbaa issife shiishanawunne issi asi oothanaw hayqqana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>He gallasappe doomidi entti iya wodhanaw maqettidosona. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Yesuusi Ayhudeta giddon qonccen simerettibeenna. Shin bazzo biitta matan de7iya Efireeme giya gutaa bis. Ba tamaaretara he bessan gam77is.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Ayhudeti bonchchiya Faasika gallasay matis. Qassi daro asay bantana geeshshanaw Faasika bonchchiya gallasay gakkanaappe sinthe he biittaafe Yerusalaame bidosona. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Entti Xoossa Keethan eqqidi Yesuusa yuussaa naagiya gisho, “Ay qoppeetii? Yesuusi baaliya bonchchanaw yeenne?” yaagidi issoy issuwa oychchidosona. <verse number="57" style="v"/>Kahine halaqatinne Farisaaweti Yesuusa oykkanaw, I de7iyasuwa eriya oonikka bantaw odana mela kiittidosona.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa shitto tiyida maccasiw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Maato 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mar 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Faasika bonchchiya gallasappe usuppun gallas sinthattidi, Yesuusi hayqoppe denthida Alaazari de7iya gutaa, Bitaaniya bis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>He bessan entti iyaw kaho giigisidosona. Alaazari Yesuusara issife gayta bolla uttidashin Martta enttana imatawusu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mayraama narddoose giya daro al77o geeshsha shitto ehada Yesuusa tohuwa tiyasu. Ba binaanan iya tohuwa quchchasu; keetha ubbay shitto sawon tongu gis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:37-38">Luuqa 7:37-38</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusa tamaaretappe issoy, Yesuusa aathi immanayssi, Yihuda Asqorooti, <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Ays ha shittoy heedzu xeetu dinaaren bayzettidi, miishey manqotas imettenne?” yaagis. <verse number="6" style="v"/>I kayso gidida gisho hessa gisippe attin manqotas qadhettidi gibeenna. I miishe karxiita oykkeyssa gidiya gisho ubba wode iyappe baw ekkees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Iya baw de7iyabaa ta moogo gallasaas minjjida gisho iyo aggaagite. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Manqoti ubba wode hinttera daana, shin taani ubba wode hinttera de7ikke” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Zaare 15:11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>He wode daro asay Yesuusi Bitaaniyan de7eyssa si7idi yaa bidosona. Entti Yesuusa xalaala gidonnashin, I hayqoppe denthida Alaazarakka be7anaw bidosona. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, kahine halaqati Alaazarakka qassi wodhanaw maqettidosona. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ays giikko, Alaazara gaason daro Ayhudeti enttana ixxidi Yesuusa ammanoosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi bonchchon Yerusalaame gelis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Maato 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luuqa 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Wonttetha gallas Faasika bonchchiya bessaa yida daro asay Yesuusi Yerusalaame beyssa si7idi, <verse number="13" style="v"/>Zambba haythi ekkidi iya mokkanaw keyidosona. Bantta qaala dhoqqu oothidi,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Hosaana! Xoossay galatetto!</para>
  <para style="q2">Godaa sunthan yeyssi anjjetto!</para>
  <para style="q2">Xoossay Isra7eele Kawuwa anjjo!”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25-26">Maz 118:25-26</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v"/>Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q">“Xiyoone katamaw, babbofa!</para>
  <para style="q2">Hekko, ne Kawoy hare mara bolla uttidi yees”</para>
  <para style="m">geetettidayssada Yesuusi hare mari demmidi iya toggis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zakka 9:9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesuusa tamaareti hessa kase akeekibookkona. Shin Yesuusi bonchchettidaappe guye entti hessa ubbaa akeekidosona. Hessi ubbay Geeshsha Maxaafay gidayssada hanis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesuusi Alaazara duufoppe xeegidi, hayqoppe denthida wode iyara de7iya daro asay Yesuusabaa markkattidosona. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Daro asay iya mokkanaw keyiday, I he malaatata oothidaysssa si7ida gishossa. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Farisaaweti issoy issuwako, “Nu aykkoka oothanaw dandda7onnayssa be7ite; dere ubbay iya kaallees” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Faasika bonchchiya gallas goynnanaw Yerusalaame bidayssata giddon issi issi Girike asati de7oosona. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Entti Galiilan biittan Beetesayda katamaappe yida Filiphphoosakko bidi, “Godaw, nuuni Yesuusa be7anaw koyoos” yaagidi woossidosona. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Filiphphoosi bidi Inddiriyasas odin nam77ay bidi, Yesuusas odidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako, “Asa Na7ay, bonchchettiya wodey gakkis. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Taani hinttew tuma odays; issi gistte ayfey biittan wodhdhidi wooqonna ixxiko barkka attees. Shin he gistte ayfey wooqiko daro ayfe ayfees. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ba shemppuwa dosiya oonikka dhayssees; ba shemppuwa ha alamiyan ixxiya oonikka merinaa de7os ashshees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Maato 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mar 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luuqa 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">17:33</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v"/>Taani de7iyasuwan taara daana mela taw oothanaw koyaa oonikka tana kaallanaw bessees. Taw oothiya oonakka ta Aaway bonchchana.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi ba hayquwaba sinthattidi odis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Ha77i ta shemppoy daro un77ettis; yaatin woygo? ‘Ta Aawaw, tana ha saateppe ashsharkkii’ yaago? Akkay, taani yiday waaye ekkanaassa. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ta Aawaw, ne sunthaa bonchcha” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">He wode saloppe, “Taani ta sunthaa bonchchas; zaaradakka bonchchana” yaagiya qaalay yis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>He bessan eqqida daro asay he qaala si7idi, “Hessi dada” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">Harati qassi, “Kiitanchchoy iyaw odis” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi enttako, “Ha qaalay hintte gisho yisippe attin ta gisho gidenna. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ha alamey pirddettiya wodey ha77i; ha alamiya haareyssi ha77i kare holettana. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Qassi taani sa7appe dhoqqu oosettida wode asa ubbaa taakko ehana” yaagis. <verse number="33" style="v"/>I hessa giday ay mela hayqo hayqqaneekko enttaw qonccisanassa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Daro asay zaaridi, “Nu higgey Kiristtoosi merinaw de7eyssa odees. Yaatin, neeni woygada, ‘Asa Na7ay dhoqqu gaanaw bessees’ gay? ‘I, Asa Na7ay oonee?’ ” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Maz 110:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isa 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:25">Hiz 37:25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:14">Daane 7:14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Poo7oy hinttera guutha wode gam77ana. Hinttew dhumonna mela poo7oy de7ishin, poo7uwan hamuttite. Dhuman hamuttiya asi aw biyakko erenna. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Poo7o nayta gidana mela poo7oy de7ishin poo7uwa ammanite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Ayhudeti ammanibookkona</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi hessa odettidaappe guye bidi enttafe geemmis. <verse number="37" style="v"/>I hessa mela malaatata entta sinthan oothinkka ammanibookkona. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nabiya Isayaasi,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Godaw, nu markkatethaa ooni ammanidee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Isa 53:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">Goday ba wolqqaa oodes qonccisidee?”</para>
  <para style="m">Gidayssi tuma gidana mela entti iya ammanibookkona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39-40" style="v"/>Qassika Isayaasi,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Entta ayfey xeellonna mela,</para>
  <para style="q2">entta wozanay akeekonna mela,</para>
  <para style="q1">entti Xoossaakko simmin, I entta pathonna mela,</para>
  <para style="q2">Xoossay entta ayfiyaa qooqisis.</para>
  <para style="q">Entta wozanaa minthis”</para>
  <para style="m">gida gisho entti ammananaw dandda7ibookkona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:39-40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:10">Isa 6:10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Isayaasi hessa giday, Yesuusa bonchchuwa be7ida gishonne iyabaa odida gishossa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Gidikkoka, Ayhudeta halaqatappekka daroti Yesuusa ammanidosona. Shin Farisaaweti banttana Ayhudeta Woosa Keethafe kessoosona gidi yayyida gisho ammanida gidi qonccen markkattibookkona. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Hessa entti oothiday, Xoossaa erettanayssafe aathidi asan erettanayssa dosida gishossa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Yesuusi ba qaalaa dhoqqu oothidi, “Tana ammaniyaa oonikka tana kiittidayssaka ammaneesppe attin ta xalaala ammanenna. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Tana be7iya oonikka tana kiittidayssaka be7ees. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Tana ammaniyaa ubbay dhuman doonna mela taani poo7o gidada alamiya yas. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Ta qaalaa si7idi kiitettonna oonakka taani pirddike. Ays giikko, taani alamiya ashshanaw yasippe attin pirddanaw yabiikke. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Tana ixxeyssanne ta qaalaa ekkonna oonakka pirddeyssi de7ees. Taani odida qaalay wurssetha gallas he uraa pirddana. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Ays giikko, taani hessa taappe odikke, shin tana kiittida ta Aaway taani gaanayssanne odanayssa kiittis. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Qassi iya kiitay merinaa de7o gideyssa taani erays. Hessa gisho, taani odeyssi ta Aaway tana oda gidayssa” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi ba tamaareta tohuwa meeccis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Faasika bonchchiya gallasay gakkanaappe sinthattidi ha alamiya aggidi Aawakko biya wodey gakkidayssa Yesuusi eris. Ha alamiyan de7iya bayssata ubba wode dosis; wurssethi gakkanawukka entta dosis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesuusaranne iya tamaaretara issife kaho moosona. Hessafe kase Xalahey Simoona na7aa Asqoroota Yihudi Yesuusa aathi immanaada iya wozanan iita qofa wothis. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesuusi Aaway ubbabaa iya kushen wothidayssa, I Xoossaa matappe yidayssanne simmidi iyaakko baanayssa eris. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesuusi gaytaa bollafe denddidi bolla bagga ma7uwa qaari wothidi, pooxa ekkidi ba xeessan marxxafis. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, haathe meechcha miishen tigidi, ba tamaareta tohuwa meeccis; qassi ba xeessan danccida pooxan quchchis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesuusi Simoona Phexiroosakko yaa wode Phexiroosi, “Godaw, ne ta tohuwa meeccanee?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi iyaakko, “Taani ootheyssa ne ha77i erakka, shin guyeppe akeekana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yaatin, Phexiroosi, “Ne ta tohuwa ubbarakka meeccaka” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi iyaakko, “Taani ne tohuwa meecconna ixxiko newunne tawunne issifetethi baawa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Phexiroosi Yesuusakko, “Godaw, yaatikko, ta tohuwa xalaala gidonnashin ta kushiyanne ta huu7iya meecca” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Bolla meecettida oonikka tohoppe harabaa meecettanaw koshshenna; iyaw ubbasoy geeshshi. Hintte geeshshi, shin ubbay geeshshi gidekketa” yaagis. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesuusi bana aathi immana uray ooneekko eriya gisho, “Hintte ubbay geeshshi gidekketa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Entta tohuwa meeccidaappe guye, Yesuusi ba ma7uwa zaari ma77is. Simmi gaytaa bolla uttidi enttako, “Taani hinttew oothidayssa akeekeetii?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:27">Luuqa 22:27</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hintte tana asttamaarenne Goda geeta; taani hintte geyssa gidiya gisho lo77o gideta. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Taani hinttew Godanne asttamaare gidashe hintte tohuwa meeccikko hintteka issoy issuwas hessada oothanaw bessees. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hiza, taani hinttew oothidayssada hintteka oothana mela hinttew leemiso gidas. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Taani hinttew tuma odays; aylley ba godaappe, kiitettidayssi kiittidayssafe aadhdhenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Maato 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luuqa 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">Yoha 15:20</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hintte hessa eridi oothiyabaa gidikko anjjettidayssata.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Taani hinttena ubbaa giikke; taani dooridayssata erays. Shin Geeshsha Maxaafan, ‘Ta barssidayssi ta kushiya saxxis’ geetettidayssi tuma gidanaw bessees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Maz 41:9</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v"/><char style="nd">Taani Tana Gideyssa</char> hintte ammanana mela hessi hananaappe sinthatada hinttew odays. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Taani hinttew tuma odays; taani kiittida oonakka mokkiya uray tana mokkees. Tana mokkiya oonikka tana kiittidayssa mokkees” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Maato 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mar 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luuqa 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">10:16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi bana aathi immanay ooneekko koyrottidi odis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Maato 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mar 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luuqa 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesuusi hessa odidaappe guye, ba wozanan daro un77ettidi, “Taani hinttew tuma odays; tana hinttefe issoy aathi immana” gidi qonccisidi odis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>I oodebaa odiyakko iya tamaaretas erettonna ixxin issoy issuwa xeellidosona. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Iya tamaaretappe issoy, Yesuusi doseyssi, Yesuusa matan uttis. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Simoon Phexiroosi iya qam77ottidi, “I oona giyakko ane oychcha” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, he tamaarey Yesuusakko shiiqidi haythan, “Godaw, I oonee?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani uythaa woxen tushada barsseyssa” yaagis. Qassi uythaa menthi ekkidi, woxen tushidi, Simoona na7aa Asqoroota Yihuda barssis. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yihudi uythaa baaridaappe guye, Xalahey sohuwara Yihudan gelis. Yesuusi iyaakko, “Neeni oothanaw qoppidabaa ellesada ootha” yaagis. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Shin gaytaa bolla uttidayssatappe oonikka Yesuusi hessa ays iyaakko gidaakko eribeenna. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yihudi miishe oykkiya gisho, iya tamaaretappe issoti issoti Yesuusi iya, “Faasika bonchchiya gallasaas banttaw koshshiyabaa shamma woykko manqotas muxaata imma gis” yaagidi qoppidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yihudi uythaa baarida mela sohuwara kare keyis. He wode sa7ay qamma.</para>
  <para style="s">Ooratha kiitaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yihudi kare keyidaappe guye, Yesuusi, “Ha77i Asa Na7ay bonchchettis; Xoossaykka iya baggara bonchchettis. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Xoossay iya baggara bonchchetiko I ba huu7en Asa Na7aa bonchchana; qassi I hessa ellesidi oothana. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ta nayto, taani hinttera daro wode gam77ike. Hintte tana koyana, shin taani Ayhudetas odidayssa mela, ‘Hintte taani biyasuwa baanaw dandda7ekketa.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:34">Yoha 7:34</ref></char></note> <verse number="34" style="v"/>Taani hinttew immiya ooratha kiitay hayssa; issoy issuwa dosite. Taani hinttena dosidayssada hintte issoy issuwa dosanaw bessees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:12">Yoha 15:12</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 15:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1Yoha 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:5">2Yoha 5</ref></char></note> <verse number="35" style="v"/>Hintte issoy issuwara dosettiko hintte ta tamaare gideyssa asa ubbay erana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Phexiroosi kaddanayssa Yesuusi koyrottidi odis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Maato 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luuqa 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Simoon Phexiroosi Yesuusakko, “Godaw, neeni aw bay?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani biyasuwa neeni ha77i kaallanaw dandda7akka, shin guyeppe tana kaallana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Phexiroosi, “Godaw, taani nena ha77i kaallanaw ays dandda7ikkinaa? Taani ne gisho, hayqqanawukka giiga uttas” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Ta gisho hayqqanaw tuma giiga uttadii? Taani new tuma odays; kuttoy waassanaappe sinthe neeni tana heedzu toho kaddana” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Aawakko efiya oge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesuusi ba tamaaretakko, “Hintte wozanay un77ettofo, Xoossaa ammanite, tanakka ammanite. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ta Aawa keethan daro bessi de7ees. Taani hinttew besse giigisanaw bays. Hessa gidonnaako taani hinttew odikkeshin. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Taani bada besse giigisidaappe guye, taani de7iyasuwan hintte daana mela simma yada hinttena taakko efana. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hintte taani biyasuwa efiya ogiya ereeta” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yaatin, Toomasi, “Godaw, neeni biyasuwa nuuni erokko; ogiya waattidi eranaw dandda7anee?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Ogey, tumaynne de7oy tana. Ta baggara gidonna ixxiko oonikka ta Aawakko baanaw dandda7enna. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hintte tana eriyabaa gidiyakko, ta Aawakka erana. Shin hizappe doomidi hintte iya ereetanne iya be7ideta” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Filiphphoosi Yesuusakko, “Godaw, Aawa nuna bessa; hessi nuus gidana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani hayssa mela wode hinttera de7inkka tana erikkii? Tana be7ida uray Aawakka be7is. Yaatin, neeni woygada, ‘Aawa nuna bessa’ gay? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Taani Aawara issino gideyssanne Aawaykka taara issino gideyssa neeni ammanikkiyye? Taani hinttew odiya qaala taani taappe odikke, shin tanan de7iya Aaway ba oosuwa oothees. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Taani Aawan de7eyssanne Aawaykka tanan de7eyssa ammanite. Hessa ammanonna ixxiko ta oothiyabatan tana ammanite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>“Taani hinttew tuma odays; tana ammaniyaa uray taani oothiya oosuwappe aadhdhiya ooso oothana. Taani Aawakko biya gisho tana ammaniyaa oonikka hayssafe aadhdhiya ooso oothana. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Aaway Na7aa baggara bonchchettana mela ta sunthan hintte woossiya ubbaa ta hinttew oothana. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ta sunthan aybibaakka hintte oychchiko ta hinttew oothana.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Geeshsha Ayyaana immanaw qaala gelis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Hintte tana dosikko ta kiitaa naagana. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Taani Aawa woossana; hinttera merinaw daana mela minthetheyssa hinttew immana. <verse number="17" style="v"/>He Ayyaanay Xoossaa tumaa qonccisees. Ha alamiya asay iya be7onna gishonne eronna gisho iya ekkanaw dandda7okkona. Shin I hinttera de7iya gishonne hintte giddon daana gisho hintte iya ereeta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Taani hinttena aaya aawu baynna na7ada hintte xalaala aggike; simmada hintteko yaana. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Guutha wodeppe guye alamey tana zaari be7enna, shin hintte be7ana. Taani de7on de7iya gisho hintteka de7on de7ana. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Taani ta Aawan, hintte tanan, qassi taani hinttenan de7eyssa hintte he gallas erana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Ta kiitaa ekkidi naagey tana dosees. Tana doseyssa ta Aawaykka dosees; taanikka iya dosays; taani iyaw qonccana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Asqoroota Yihuda gidonna Yihudi Yesuusakko, “Godaw, neeni waatada alamiyas gidonnashin nuus nena qonccisanee?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Tana dosiya oonikka ta qaalas kiitettana. Ta Aaway iya dosana. Qassi ta Aawaynne taani iyaakko yidi iyara daana. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Tana dosonna oonikka ta qaalas kiitettenna. Hintte si7iya qaalay tana kiittida Aawayssafe attin tabaa gidenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Taani hinttera ha77i de7ashe hessa hinttew odas. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Shin Aaway ta sunthan kiittana minthethiya Geeshsha Ayyaanay, hinttena ubbabaa tamaarssana. Taani hinttew odida ubbaa I hinttena hassayisana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Sarotethaa hinttew immana. Taani ta sarotethaa hinttew immana. Ta immiya sarotethaay alamey immiya sarotethaa mela gidenna. Hessa gisho, un77ettofite, yayyofite. <verse number="28" style="v"/>‘Taani baana, shin simmada hintteko yaana’ gidayssa si7ideta. Hintte tana tuma dosiyabaa gidiyakko ta Aaway taappe aadhdhiya gisho taani iyaakko beyssan hintte ufayttana. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hessi haniya wode hintte ammanana mela hessi hanonna de7ishin sinthatada taani hinttew odas.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>“Ha alamiya haareyssi yaa gisho hizappe guye hinttera daro odettike. Tana I aykkoka oothanaw dandda7enna. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Shin taani Aawa doseyssa alamey erana mela ta Aaway tana kiittidayssa ubbaa oothays. Denddite; hayssafe boos.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Woyniya tuma ubbay Yesuusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Taani woyniya tuma ubbaa. Goshshanchchoy ta Aawa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ta bolla de7iya ayfe ayfonna tashiya ubbaa I karees. Ayfiyaa tashiya kaseyssafe aadhdhi ayfana mela he tashiya I giigisana. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Taani hinttew odida qaala gisho hintte geeshshi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Tanan de7ite; taanikka hinttenan de7ana. Woyniya tashey ubbaara de7onna ixxiko he tashey barkka ayfe ayfanaw dandda7enna. Hessadakka, hintteka tanan de7onna ixxiko ayfe ayfanaw dandda7ekketa.</para>
  <para style="rem">fig 15 fig*</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Taani woyniya ubbaa; hintte tasheta. Tanan de7eysinne taani iyan de7eyssi, I daro ayfe ayfana. Ta baynna hintte xalaala aykkoka oothanaw dandda7ekketa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Tanan doonna uray tashiyada karen yegittidi melana. Hessa mela tasheti shiiqidi taman yeggettana, xuugettana. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hintte tanan de7ikko, ta qaalaykka hinttenan de7ikko, hintte koyabay aybaa gidikkoka woossite; hintte ekkana. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hintte daro ayfe ayfiyaa ta tamaare gidikko, hessan ta Aaway bonchchettana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Aaway tana doseyssada taanikka hinttena dosays; ta siiquwan de7ite. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Taani ta Aawa kiitaa naagada iya siiquwan de7idayssada hintteka ta kiitaa naagikko ta siiquwan daana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Ta ufayssay hinttenan gidana melanne hintte ufayssay polo gidana mela taani hinttew hessa odas. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ta kiitay hayssa; taani hinttena dosidayssada hintteka issoy issuwa dosite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Yoha 13:34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:17">15:17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1Yoha 3:23</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ba shemppuwa ba laggiyas aathidi immeyssafe aadhdhiya gita siiqoy baawa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Taani hinttena kiittidaba ubbaa oothiko hintte dosettidayssata.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Aylley ba goday oothiyabaa eronna gisho taani hinttena hizappe guye aylleta giikke. Shin ta Aawappe si7ida ubbaa taani hinttew odida gisho hinttena dosettidayssata gas. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Taani hinttena doorasippe attin hintte tana dooribeekketa. Hintte bidi dhayonna ayfe ayfana mela taani hinttena shuumas. Yaanikko ta Aaway hintte ta sunthan woossidaba ubbaa immana. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ta kiitay hayssa: issoy issuwa dosite.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi alamey ixxanayssa odis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Alamey hinttena ixxiko koyrottidi tana ixxidayssa akeekite. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hintte alamiyabaa gidiyakko alamey babaada hinttena dosana. Shin taani hinttena alameppe doorida gishonne hintte alamiyabaa gidonna gisho alamey hinttena ixxees. <verse number="20" style="v"/>‘Aylley ba godaappe aadhdhenna’ gada taani hinttew odidayssa akeekite. Entti tana gooddidabaa gidikko hinttenakka gooddana. Entti ta qaala naagidabaa gidikko hintte qaalaakka naagana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Maato 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luuqa 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Yoha 13:16</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v"/>Shin entti tana kiittidayssa eronna gisho ha ubbaa ta gaason hintte bolla oothana. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Taani yada enttaw odonnabaa gidiyakko nagara gidenna. Shin ha77i entti oothida nagaraas gaasoyabay baawa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Tana ixxeyssi ta Aawakka ixxees. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Oonikka oothiboonna ooso ta entta giddon oothaboonnabaa gidiyakko enttaw nagara gidonna attana. Shin ha77i entti taani oothida oosuwa be7idi tanakka ta Aawakka ixxidosona. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Shin entta higgiyan, ‘Tana coo ixxidosona’ geetettidi xaafettidayssi polettana mela hessi hanis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 35:19">Maz 35:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:4">69:4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Aawappe yaa tumaa qonccisiya Ayyaana ta hinttew kiittana. I hinttena minthethana, tabaa markkattana. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hintteka koyroppe doomidi taara de7iya gisho tabaa markkattana.</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Taani hessa hintte ammanoy dhayonna mela hinttew odas. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Entti hinttena Ayhude Woosa Keethatappe kessi yeddana. Hessadakka, hinttena wodhiya oonikka Xoossi koyabaa oothiya daaniya wodey yaana. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Entti hessa hintte bolla oothey tana woykko Aawa eronna gishossa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Shin entti hessa hintte bolla oothiya wodey gakkiya wode taani hinttew odididayssa hintte akeekana mela taani hinttew hayssa odas.</para>
  <para style="s">Geeshsha Ayyaana oosuwa</para>
  <para style="p">“Sinthatada taani hayssa hinttew odonna gam77iday ta hinttera de7iya gishossa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Shin ha77i taani tana kiittidayssako bays; hinttefe oonikka, ‘Awu bay?’ gidi tana oychchey baawa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Shin taani hessa odida gisho, hintte wozanan daro azzanoy de7ees. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Shin taani hinttew tuma odays; taani beyssi hinttew lo77o. Ays giikko, taani boonna ixxiko minthetheyssi hintteko yeenna. Shin taani biikko iya hintteko yeddana. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Minthetheyssi yidi, nagarabaa, xillotethabaanne pirddabaa ha alamiya asaa erisana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nagarabay, asay tana ammanonna gishossa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Xillotethabay, taani Aawakko biya gishonne hintte tana zaari be7onna gishossa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Pirddabay, qassi alamiya haareyssi pirddettida gishossa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>“Taani hinttew odiyabay darobay de7ees, shin ha77i hinttew gelenna. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Tuma Ayyaanay yaa wode hinttena tumatetha ubbaako kaalethana. I si7idabaa odeesippe attin baappe aybibaakka odenna. Qassi sinthafe yaanabaa hinttew I odana. <verse number="14" style="v"/>I taw de7eyssafe ekkidi hinttew odiya gisho I tana bonchchana. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Aawas de7iyaba ubbay tabaa; ‘Minthetheyssi taw de7eyssafe ekkidi hinttew odana’ taani giday hessassa.</para>
  <para style="s">Hintte azzanoy ufayssan laamettana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Guutha wodeppe guye tana be7ekketa; qassi guutha wodeppe guye hintte tana be7ana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Iya tamaaretappe issoti issoti bantta giddon, “Guutha wodeppe guye hintte tana be7ekketa; qassi guutha wodeppe guye hintte tana be7ana; qassika taani Aawakko bays guussay woy guussee?” yaagidosona. <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Guutha wodeppe guye geyssi woy guussee? I ay odettiyako nuus erettenna” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Entti bana oychchanaw koyeyssa Yesuusi eridi, “Taani, ‘Guutha wodeppe guye tana be7ekketa; qassi guutha wodeppe guye hintte tana be7ana’ gidayssas hintte issoy issuwa oychcheetii? <verse number="20" style="v"/>Taani hinttew tuma odays; hintte yeekkananne afuxana, shin ha alamey ufayttana. Ha77i hintte azzanana, shin hintte azzanoy ufayssan laamettana. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Issi maccasiya na7a yelana haniya wode ba yelo wodey gakkida gisho hirggawusu. Shin na7a yelidaappe guye na7i ha alamiyan yelettida ufayssaa gisho ba un77aa dogawusu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hessadakka, hintteka hintte wozanan azzaneeta, shin taani hinttena zaarada be7ana. Hintte wozanay daro ufayttana; he ufayssaa oonikka hinttefe ekkenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“He gallas hintte tana aybibaakka woosseketa. Taani hinttew tuma odays; hintte ta sunthan woossiyabaa ubbaa Aaway hinttew immana. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ha77i gakkanaw ta sunthan aybibaakka woossibeekketa. Hintte ufayssay polo gidana mela Xoossaa woossite; hintte ekkana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Taani ha77i gakkanaw hinttew leemison odas, hizappe taani leemison odonna wodey yaana. Shin Aawabaa taani hinttew qonccen odana. <verse number="26" style="v"/>He gallas hintte ta sunthan Aawa woossana; hintte gisho taani Aawa woossike. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ays giikko, Aaway ba huu7en hinttena dosees. Hintte tana dosiya gishonne taani Aawa matappe yidayssa ammanida gisho, I hinttena dosees. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Taani Aawa matappe ha alamiya yas; qassi alamiya aggada Aawakko baana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Iya tamaareti zaaridi, “Hekko, ha77i neeni qonccen odaasa; leemison aykkoka odakka. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Neeni ubbabaa ereyssa nuuni ha77i eroos; qassi nena oonikka oychchana mela neeni koyakka. Hessi nuna neeni Xoossafe kiitettidayssa ammanthees” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yaatin, Yesuusi zaaridi enttako, “Ha77i ammaneetii? <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hekko, hinttee, hintte soo hintte soo laalettiya wodeynne ta xalaala yeggi aggidi baqatiya wodey yaana; ha77ika yikichchis. Shin Aaway taara de7iya gisho ta ta xalaala gidikke. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hintte taara de7ishe saroy hinttew daana mela taani hessa odas. Alamen de7ishe hintte waayettana. Shin minnite; taani alamiya xoonas” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa woosaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesuusi hessa odidaappe guye pude salo xeellidi, hayssada yaagis: “Aawaw, saatey gakkis; ne Na7ay nena bonchchana mela neeni ne Na7aa bonchcha. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Neeni iyaw immida ubbaas I merinaa de7uwa immana mela asa ubbaa bolla iyaw maata immadasa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Merinaa de7oy, nena, issi tuma Xoossaanne ne kiittida Yesuus Kiristtoosa ero. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Neeni ta oothana mela immida oosuwa polada nena sa7an bonchchas. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ha77ika, Aawaw, alamey medhettanaappe sinthe ne matan taw de7iya bonchchuwan tana bonchcha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Alamiya asaappe neeni taw immidayssata nena erisas. Entti neyssata; neeni entta taw immadasa. Entti ne qaalaskka kiitettidosona. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Neeni taw immida ubbabay neeppe yidayssa entti ha77i eroosona. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Neeni taw immida qaala taani enttaw immas; enttika he qaala ekkidosona. Taani ne matappe yidayssi tuma gideyssa eridi neeni tana kiittidayssaka ammanidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Taani enttaw woossays. Entti neyssata gidiya gisho neeni taw immida asaas woossaysippe attin alamiyas woossike. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Taw de7iya ubbabay nebaa; new de7iya ubbayka tabaa. Taani entta baggara bonchchettas. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Taani hizappe guye alamiyan de7ikke; entti alamen de7oosona. Taani ha77i neekko bays. Geeshsha Aawaw, ha neeni taw immidayssati neeranne taara issino gididayssada entti issino gidana mela entta ne taw immida ne sunthan naaga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Taani enttara sa7an de7ashe, ne taw immida ne sunthaa wolqqan entta naagas. Geeshsha Maxaafay gidayssi polettana mela dhayoy bessiya uraappe attin enttafe hari oonikka dhayibeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Maz 41:9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:18">Yoha 13:18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Ha77i taani neekko bays. Ta ufayssay entta wozanan polo gidana mela hayssa taani alamen de7ashe odays. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Taani enttaw ne qaala immas. Taani alamiyappe gidonnayssada, enttika alameppe gidonna gisho, alamey entta ixxis. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Neeni Xalaheppe entta naagana melappe attin alameppe kessana mela woossike. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Taani alameppe gidonnayssada enttika alameppe gidokkona. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Neeni ne tumatethan entta nebaa ootha; ne qaalaykka tuma. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Neeni tana alamiya kiittidayssada taanikka entta alamiya kiittas. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Qassi entti tuma nebaa gidana mela entta gisho taani ta huu7iya new immays.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Taani entta xalaalas gidonnashin entti qaala odin, tana ammananayssataskka woossays. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Entti ubbay issino gidana mela taani woossays. Aawaw, ne tanan de7eyssada, qassi ta nenan de7eyssada entti nunan daana mela woossays. He wode neeni tana kiittidayssa alamey ammanana. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Neeninne taani issino gideyssada, entti issino gidana mela, neeni tana bonchchidayssada, taanikka entta bonchchas. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Taani enttan, neeni tanan de7eyssada entti polo issino gidana mela nena woossays. Hessika, ne tana kiittidayssanne ne tana dosida dosuwan entta siiqidayssa alamey eran melassa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Aawaw, neeni taw immidayssati taani de7iyasuwan taara daana mela koyays. Alamey medhettanaappe sinthe neeni tana dosida gisho, taw immida ta bonchchuwa entti be7ana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Geeshsha Aawaw, alamey nena erenna, shin taani erays. Qassi neeni tana kiittidayssa hayssati eroosona. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Neeni tana siiqida siiqoy enttanan daana mela, qassi taani enttanan gidana mela, taani ne sunthaa entta erisas; sinthaskka erisana” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa oyketethaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Maato 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luuqa 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesuusi woossaa onggidaappe guye ba tamaaretara Qediroona zanggaara pinnidi, he bessan de7iya atakilttiya giddo gelidosona. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesuusi ubba wode ba tamaaretara yan shiiqiya gisho Yesuusa aathi immida Yihudi he bessaa erees. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Yihudi paanose, xomppe, tooranne gonddalle oykkida daro wotaaddareta, kahine halaqatinne Farisaaweti kiittida Xoossa Keetha naagiya pooliseta kaalethi ekkidi, he bessaa bis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesuusi bana gakkana haniyabaa ubbaa eridi, gaxa keyidi, “Oona koyeetii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Entti zaaridi, “Naazirete Yesuusa koyoos” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">I zaaridi, “Taani Yesuusa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusa aathi immida Yihudi yan enttara eqqis. <verse number="6" style="v"/>I, “Taani Yesuusa” gida wode entti guye shiiqidi, sa7an kunddidosona. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesuusi qassika, “Oona koyeetii?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">Entti, “Naazirete Yesuusa koyoos” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>I zaaridi, “Taani Yesuusa gideyssa hinttew odas. Hiza, hintte tana koyabaa gidikko hayssata yeddite” yaagis. <verse number="9" style="v"/>I hessa giday, “Aawaw, neeni taw immidayssatappe hari attoshin issuwaka dhayssabiikke” gidayssi polettana melassa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Simoon Phexiroosas bisoy de7ees. I he bisuwa shoddidi kahine halaqaa aylliyas ushachcha haytha shocidi, qanxi yeggis. He aylliya sunthay Malkkoosa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesuusi Phexiroosakko, “Ne bisuwa shoohuwan zaara. Ta Aaway taw immida xuu7appe taani uyonnabaa new daanii?” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:39">Maato 26:39</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:36">Mar 14:36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:42">Luuqa 22:42</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Haanna sinthe shiiqis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57">Maato 26:57</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:58">58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53">Mar 14:53</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:54">54</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54">Luuqa 22:54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Roome wotaaddaretinne entta halaqay Xoossa Keetha naagiya poolisetara issife Yesuusa oykkidi qachchidosona. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Koyro Yesuusa Haannako efidosona. Haanni he laythi kahine halaqa gidiya Qayyaafa bollo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Qayyaafi, “Asa ubbaa gisho, issi asi hayqqiko lo77o” gidi kase Ayhudeta zoridayssa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:49-50">Yoha 11:49-50</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Phexiroosi Yesuusa kaddis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Maato 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mar 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luuqa 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Simoon Phexiroosinne hara issi tamaarey Yesuusa kaallidi bidosona. Kahine halaqay he hara tamaariya loythi erees. Hessa gisho, I Yesuusara kahine halaqaa zabbaa gelis. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Shin Phexiroosi karera dirssaa penggen eqqis. Kahine halaqay eriya hara tamaarey kare keyidi, penggiya naagiya na7ees odidi, Phexiroosa gaathi gelssis. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Penggiya naagiya na7iya Phexiroosakko, “Neeni, addiya tamaaretappe issuwa gidikkii?” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">Phexiroosi zaaridi, “Akkay, taani gidikke” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Sa7ay meeggiya gisho, aylletinne naageyssati xiifa tama eethidi, yuuyi aadhdhi eqqidi kayosona. Phexiroosikka enttara eqqidi tama kayees.</para>
  <para style="s">Kahine Halaqay Yesuusa oychchis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Maato 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mar 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luuqa 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kahine halaqay Yesuusa, iya tamaaretabaanne iya timirttiyabaa oychchis. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani asa ubbaas qonccen odas. Taani Ayhude ubbay shiiqiya Ayhude Woosa Keethaninne Xoossa Keethan ubba wode tamaarssas. Geeman aykkoka odabiikke. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yaatin, neeni tana ays oychchay? Ta odishin si7ida asaa oychcha. He asay taani odididayssa eroosona” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesuusi hessa gida wode, he bessan eqqida wotaaddaretappe issoy Yesuusa baqqidi, “Kahine halaqaa bolla hayssada zaaray?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani iitabaa odidabaa gidikko hayssan de7iya asa ubbaa sinthan oda. Shin taani tuma odidabaa gidikko tana ays baqqay?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Haanni, Yesuusi qashettida mela kahine halaqaa Qayyaafakko yeddis.</para>
  <para style="s">Phexiroosi Yesuusa zaari kaddis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Maato 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mar 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luuqa 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Phexiroosi yan eqqidi, tama kayishin, harati iyaakko, “Neeni ha addiya tamaaretappe issuwa gidikkii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Phexiroosi zaaridi, “Akkay, taani gidikke” yaagidi kaddis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kahine halaqaa aylletappe issoy, Phexiroosi haythaa qanxida addiya dabboy, Phexiroosakko, “Taani nena iyara atakilttiya giddon be7abiikkina?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Phexiroosi qassika kaddis. Sohuwara kuttoy waassi aggis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Philaaxoosa sinthan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Maato 27:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mar 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luuqa 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Wontta guura, entti Yesuusa Qayyaafa sooppe deriya haareyssa ooso keethi ekki efidosona. Ayhudeti Faasika Baale kathaa maanaw banttana tunisonna mela deriya haareyssa ooso keethaa gelibookkona. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Philaaxoosi enttako kare keyidi, “Ha addiya ays mooteetii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Entti, “I iita oothonnabaa gidiyakko nuuni iya neekko ehokko” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Philaaxoosi zaaridi, “Hintte iya ekki efidi, hintte higgey geyssada iya bolla pirddite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Ayhudeti, “Oonakka wodhiya maati nuus baawa” yaagidosona; <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hessi haniday Yesuusi ay mela hayqo hayqqaneekko erisanaw odidayssi polettanaassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:14">Yoha 3:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:32">12:32</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Philaaxoosi ba ooso keetha zaari gelidi, Yesuusa xeegidi, “Neeni Ayhude kawo?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesuusi Philaaxoosa, “Ha oysha neeni neeppe oychchayye woykko hara asi new tabaa odidee?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Philaaxoosi zaaridi, “Ta Ayhude asi? Ne asaynne kahine halaqati nena taw aathi immidosona. Ne ay oothadii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Ta kawotethay ha alamiyana gidenna. I hayssan gidiyakko ta Ayhudeta halaqatas aadhdha imettonna mela ta aylleti taw olettana. Shin ta kawotethay ha alamiyana gidenna” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Philaaxoosi Yesuusakko, “Yaatin, neeni kawoyye?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi zaaridi, “Tuma ta kawo gideyssa ne gadasa. Taani yelettidaynne ha alamiya yiday tumatethaas markkattanassa. Tumaa bagga gidida oonikka taani geyssa si7ees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Philaaxoosi, “Tumi aybee?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Philaaxoosi hessa gidaappe guye Ayhudetakko kare keyidi, “Taani iyappe ay iitakka demmabiikke. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Shin Faasika Baale gallas, issi ase hinttew qashoppe billiya meezey de7ees. Taani hinttew Ayhudeta kawuwa billana mela koyeetii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Entti zaaridi, bantta qaalaa dhoqqu oothidi, “Barbbaana billafe attin iya gidenna” yaagidosona. Shin Barbbaani pangga.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Wotaaddareti Yesuusa toochchidosona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-32">Maato 27:27-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:15-21">Mar 15:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Philaaxoosi Yesuusa garaafisis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Wotaaddareti aguntha kallachcha medhdhidi iya huu7en wothidosona. Qassi zo7o ma7o iya mayzidosona. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Iyaakko shiiqidi, “Ayhude kawuwaw, merinaw kawota” yaagidi iya baqqidosona.</para>
  <para style="rem">fig 16 fig*</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Philaaxoosi qassika kare keyidi, Ayhudetakko, “Hekko, taani iyappe ay iitakka demmaboonnayssa hintte erana mela iya hintteko kare kessana” yaagis. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi aguntha kallachcha ba huu7en wothidi, zo7o ma7o ma7idi, kare keyis. Philaaxoosi Ayhudetakko, “Uraa hayssa be7ite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kahine halaqatinne Xoossa Keetha naageyssati iya be7ida wode, bantta qaala dhoqqu oothidi, “Masqaliya bolla kaqqa! Kaqqa!” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">Philaaxoosi enttako, “Hintte iya efidi, masqaliya bolla kaqqite. Taani iyappe ay iitakka demmabiikke” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ayhudeti zaaridi, “Nuus higgey de7ees. I bana Xoossaa na7a oothida gisho nu higgiyatho I hayqqanaw bessees” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Philaaxoosi hessa si7ida wode kaseyssafe daro yayyis. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Qassika Philaaxoosi ba ooso keethi simmi gelidi Yesuusakko, “Neeni awuppe yadi?” yaagidi oychchis. Shin Yesuusi iyaw aykkoka zaaribeenna. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Philaaxoosi, “Taw odikkii? Nena billanaw woykko masqaliya bolla kaqqanaw taw maati de7eyssa erikkii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Xoossay new maata immiboonnabaa gidiyakko ta bolla maati new deennashin. Hessa gisho, tana new aathi immidays aadhdhiya nagara oothis” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa bolla hayqo pirddidosona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Maato 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mar 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luuqa 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Philaaxoosi hessa si7ida wode Yesuusa billanaw oge koyis. Shin Ayhudeti bantta qaala dhoqqu oothidi, “Neeni iya billiyabaa gidikko Kawuwa Qeesare bagga gidakka. Bana kawo giya oonikka Qeesare morkke” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Philaaxoosi hessa si7idi Yesuusa kare kessis. Yaatidi, “Lochche Shuchchi” giyason pirdda oydiyan uttis. Ibraysxe qaalan he bessay “Gabate” guussu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>He gallasay Faasika Baale bonchchanaw giigetetha gallas. Sa7ay usuppun saate heera. Philaaxoosi Ayhudetakko, “Hintte kawuwa hayssa be7ite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ayhudeti bantta qaala dhoqqu oothidi, “Digga! Digga! Masqaliya bolla kaqqa” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">Philaaxoosi zaaridi, “Hintte kawuwa taani masqaliya bolla kaqqanayssa koyeetii?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">Kahine halaqati, “Qeesareppe hara kawoy nuus baawa” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, entti Yesuusa masqaliya bolla kaqqana mela Philaaxoosi enttaw aathi immis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi kaqettis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Maato 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luuqa 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">Entti Yesuusa oykkidi efidosona. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesuusi ba masqaliya tookkidi, “Huu7e guugge” giya bessaa bis. “Huu7e guugge” guussay Ibraysxe qaalan “Golggotta” guussu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Entti he bessan masqaliya bolla Yesuusa kaqqidosona. Qassi iyara hara nam77u asata, issuwa ya baggara hankkuwa ha baggara masqaliya bolla kaqqidosona. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Philaaxoosi, “Ayhudeta Kawuwa, Naazirete Yesuusa” yaagiya xuufe xaafidi masqaliya bolla wothis. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesuusi masqaliya bolla kaqettida bessay katamaas matan de7iya gisho, daro Ayhudeti he xuufiya nabbabidosona. Xuufey xaafettiday Ibraysxe doonan, Laatine doonaninne Girike doonana. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, kahine halaqati Philaaxoosakko, “‘Ha addey bana Ayhude kawo yaagis’ gada xaafappe attin ‘Ayhude kawo’ gada xaafoppa” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yaatin, Philaaxoosi, “Ta xaafidayssa xaafas” yaagidi zaaris.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Wotaaddareti masqaliya bolla iya kaqqidaappe guye, iya ma7uwa ekkidi, oyddu bessan shaakkidi, isso isso ekkidosona. Yeda ma7ettiya iya adussa ma7uwa ekkidosona. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Wotaaddareti, “Oona gakkaneekko, saama yegganaappe attin ma7uwa peedhokko” yaagidosona. Hessi haniday Geeshsha Maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Ta ma7uwa shaakki ekkidosona;</para>
  <para style="q2">ta adussa ma7uwa bollaka saama yeggidosona”</para>
  <para style="m">geetettidayssi polettana melassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Maz 22:18</ref></char></note> Hessa gisho, wotaaddareti hessa oothidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusa masqaliya matan iya aayiya, iya aaye michchiya, Qeliyopha machchiya Mayraamanne Magdela Mayraama eqqidosona. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesuusi ba aayiwunne I dosiya tamaarey yan eqqidayssata be7idi, ba aayeko, “Ta aaye, ne na7aa hayssa be7a” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, he tamaariyakko, “Ne aayiw hanno be7a” yaagis. He tamaarey iyo he wodeppe doomidi baara daana mela soo efis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi hayqqis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Maato 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luuqa 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi ubbay ha77i polettidayssa eridi, Geeshsha Maxaafan xaafettidayssi polettana mela “Tana saamees” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Maz 69:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:15">22:15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>He bessan issi xugga kumetha caala woyney de7ees. Entti ispponjje he woyniyan yeggidi, hisophe mitha xeeran wothidi, Yesuusa doonaakko shiishidosona. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesuusi woyniya ganxi be7idi, “Polettis” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="rem">fig 17 fig*</para>
  <para style="p">Hessafe guye, ba huu7iya ziqqi oothidi ba shemppuwa immis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa miya tooran caddidosona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>He gallasay giigetetha gallas gidiya gishonne wonttetha gallasay bonchcho Sambbaata gidiya gisho, asata ahay masqaliya bolla Sambbaata gallas pee7onna mela entta tohuwa menthidi, masqaliyappe wodhisana mela Ayhudeti Philaaxoosa woossidosona. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, wotaaddareti bidi, Yesuusara kaqettida nam77u asata tohuwa menthidosona. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusakko yida wode I hayqqidayssa be7idi, iya tohuwa menthibookkona. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Shin wotaaddaretappe issoy iya miya tooran caddin sohuwara suuthinne haathi goggis. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Hintte ammanana mela hessa be7idayssi markkattis. Iya markkatethayka tuma. Qassi I odeyssi tuma gideyssa erees. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Hessi haniday Geeshsha Maxaafay, “Iya meqethatappe issoykka meqqenna” gidayssi polettana melassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Kessa 12:46</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 9:12">Tay 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:20">Maz 34:20</ref></char></note> <verse number="37" style="v"/>Qassika Geeshsha Maxaafay hara bessan, “Entti bantta caddidayssa be7ana” yaagees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zakka 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Yo@Qo 1:7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi moogettis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Maato 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luuqa 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Armmatiyasa katamaappe yida Yoosefi Yesuusa ahaa ekkanaw Philaaxoosa woossis. Yoosefi Ayhudetas yayyida gisho qosan Yesuusa kaalleyssa.</para>
  <para style="p">Philaaxoosi, “Ekka” yaagis. Hessa gisho, Yoosefi bidi Yesuusa ahaa ekkis. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Qassi Niqodimoosi hessafe kase Yesuusakko qamma yidayssi, karbbenne godare uuthara walakettida hasttamanne issi kilo giraame gidiya shitto ekkidi Yoosefara yis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:1-2">Yoha 3:1-2</ref></char></note> <verse number="40" style="v"/>He nam77u asati Yesuusa ahaa ekkidi, Ayhudeti aha xaaxiya maaran, shittora, moogo afilan xaaxidosona. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesuusi masqaliya bolla kaqettida bessan daro atakilttey de7ees. He atakilttiya giddon shuchchafe woocettidi oosettida buroo oonikka moogettibonna ooratha duufoy de7ees. <verse number="42" style="v"/>He gonggoloy matan de7iya gishonne Ayhudeti Sambbaatas giigettiya gallas gidiya gisho, Yesuusa ahaa yan moogidosona.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi hayqoppe denddis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Maato 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mar 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luuqa 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Wogga wode wontta buroo geeyonna de7ishin, Magdela Mayraama, Yesuusi moogettida duufuwa bada shuchchay he duufuwa doonappe denddidayssa be7asu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Simoon Phexiroosakkonne Yesuusi dosiya hankko tamaariyakko woxxa bada, “Duufuwappe Godaa efidosona; iya awun wothidaakko nu erokko” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Phexiroosinne hankko tamaarey keyidi duufuwa bidosona. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nam77ayka issife woxxidosona, shin hankko tamaarey Phexiroosappe aadhdhidi sinthattidi duufuwa gakkis. <verse number="5" style="v"/>He tamaarey hokkidi, moogo afilaa be7is, shin duufuwan wodhdhibeenna. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Simoon Phexiroosi iya kaalli yidi, duufuwan wodhdhidi moogo afilay yan de7eyssa be7is. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Qassi Yesuusa huu7en xaaxettida afilay xaaxettida mela dumma issi bessan de7eyssa be7is. He afilay dumma de7eesippe attin moogo afilaara issife deenna. <verse number="8" style="v"/>He wode, sinthattidi duufuwa gakkida hankko tamaarey geli be7idi ammanis. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesuusi hayqoppe denddanaw besseyssa odiya Geeshsha maxaafaa qaala entti buroo akeekibookkona. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, iya tamaareti bantta soo simmi bidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Magdela Mayraamis benttis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Maato 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mar 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Shin Mayraama he duufuwa doonan eqqada yeekkashe hokkada duufuwa giddo xeellasu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Bootha ma7o ma77ida nam77u kiitanchchoti Yesuusa ahay zin77idasuwan issoy huu7esoora hankkoy tohosoora uttidashin be7asu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Entti ikko, “Maccasete, ays yeekkay?” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">Iya, “Entti ta Godaa efidosona; entti awun wothidaakko taani erikke” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hessa gidaappe guye, iya guye simma xeelliya wode, Yesuusi yan eqqidayssa be7asu. Shin I Yesuusa gididayssa erabuukku. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesuusi iikko, “Maccasete, ays yeekkay? Oona koyay?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">Mayraama atakiltte oosanchchuwa daanin, “Godaw, ne ekkidabaa gidikko, iya awun wothidaakko taw odarkkii. Taani iya ekkana” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesuusi iikko, “Mayraame” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Iya iyaakko simmada, Ibraysxe doonan “Rebuuni” yaagasu. Hessas birshshethay “Asttamaariyaw” guussu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesuusi iikko, “Taani buroo ta Aawakko boonna gisho, tana oykka ashshanaw koyoppa. Shin ta ishatakko bada, ‘Taani ta Aawakkonne hintte Aawakko, ta Xoossaakonne hintte Xoossaako, simmana gis’ gada enttaw oda” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Magdela Mayraama Godaa be7idayssanne iw hessa I odididayssa bada iya tamaaretas odasu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi ba tamaaretas qonccis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Maato 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luuqa 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Wogga wode omarssi, iya tamaareti Ayhudetas yayyidi kariya gorddidi shiiqi uttidashin, Yesuusi yidi, entta giddon eqqidi, “Saroy hinttew gido” yaagis. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hessa gidi simmidi ba kushiyanne ba miya entta bessis. Iya tamaareti Godaa be7ida wode daro ufayttidosona. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi enttako, “Saroy hinttew gido; ta Aaway tana kiittidayssada taanikka hinttena kiittays” yaagis. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hessa gidayssafe guye, entta bolla ufu gidi punnis. Qassi, “Geeshsha Ayyaana ekkite. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hintte atto gida asaa nagaray atto geetettana. Hintte atto goonnayssata nagaray atto geetettenna” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:19">Maato 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:18">18:18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusanne Toomasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Shin tammanne nam77u tamaaretappe issoy, Didimoosa <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Didimoosa geyssa birshshetha Yoha 11:16 xeellite.</char></note> geetettiya Toomasi, Yesuusi yida wode enttara deenna. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, hankko iya tamaareti Toomasakko, “Nuuni Godaa be7ida” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">Shin Toomasi enttako, “Misimaren I cadettida iya kushiyan de7iya beeta be7onnanne he beeta ta biradhdhen bochchonna, qassi ta kushiya iya miyan yedda be7onna ammanikke” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Saaminttafe guye, Yesuusa tamaareti qassika son shiiqidi uttidosona; Toomasikka enttara de7ees. Karey gorddettidi de7ishin Yesuusi yidi, entta giddon eqqidi, “Saroy hinttew gido” yaagis. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi Toomasakko, “Ta kushiya ne biradhdhen bochchada be7a. Qassi ne kushiya ta miyiyan yedda be7a. Neeni sidhoppa, ammana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Toomasi zaaridi, “Ta Godaw, ta Xoossaw” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yaatin Yesuusi, “Neeni tana be7ida gisho ammanadasa, shin tana be7onna ammanidayssati anjjettidayssata” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Ha maxaafaa qofaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesuusi ha maxaafan xaafettiboonna hara daro malaatata ba tamaareta sinthan oothis. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi I Kiristtoosa, Xoossaa Na7aa gideyssa hintte ammanana melanne ammanidi iya sunthan de7o demmana mela hessi xaafettis.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi laappun ba tamaaretas qonccis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi Xibiryadoosa Abbaa matan ba tamaaretas zaari qonccis. I enttaw hayssafe kaallidi de7iya hanotan qonccis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Simoon Phexiroosi, Mentte geetettiya Toomasi, Qaana Galiilappe yida Natina7eeli, Zabdiyoosa naytinne Yesuusa tamaaretappe hara nam77ati issife de7oosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Simoon Phexiroosi enttako, “Taani molo oykkanaw bays” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:5">Luuqa 5:5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">Entti, “Nukka neera baana” yaagidi, wogoluwa giddo gelidosona. Shin entti he qamman aybi molokka oykkibookkona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wontta guura xalqey dolanaappe sinthe, Yesuusi abbaa gaxan eqqis, shin iya tamaareti Yesuusa gididayssa erbookkona. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako, “Ta laggeto, molo oykkibeekketii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Entti zaaridi, “Aykkoka oykkibookko” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>I zaaridi, “Hintte gitiya wogoluwappe ushachcha baggara yeggite; guutha molo hintte oykkana” yaagis. Hessa gisho, gitiya ushachcha baggara yeggidosona. Moloy darida gisho goochchi kessanaw xoonettidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:6">Luuqa 5:6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesuusi dosiya tamaarey Phexiroosakko, “Hayssi Godaa!” yaagis. Simoon Phexiroosi I Godaa gidayssa si7ida wode, kallo de7iya gisho, ba ma7uwa ma7idi abbaa giddo guppi gelis. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Shin wogoluwan attida hankko tamaareti moloy kumida gitiya goochchidi, abbaafe gaxa keyidosona. Entti abbaafe nam77u xeetu wadha mela haakkoosona. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Entti abbaafe gaxa keyida wode, xiifa bonqon moloy de7eyssanne uythi be7idosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako, “Ha77i hintte oykkida moluwappe guuthara hammite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Simoon Phexiroosi wogoluwan gelidi, xeetanne ishatammanne heedzu wogga moloti kumida gitiya goochchidi abbaafe gaxa kessis. Moloy hessa mela daro gidin gitey daakettibeenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako, “Haa yidi miite” yaagis. I Godaa gideyssa entti erida gisho, iya tamaaretappe issoykka, “Neeni oonee?” gidi iya oychchanaw minniday baawa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesuusi yidi, uythaa ekkidi enttaw immis; moluwakka hessada immis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesuusi hayqoppe denddidi ba tamaaretas qonccishin hayssi heedzantho.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusanne Phexiroosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Entti midaappe guye, Yesuusi Simoon Phexiroosakko, “Yoona <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:15 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Yoona: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Girike doonan Yoona giya sunthay Yohaannisa giya sunthaas saphotho sunthu.</char></note> na7aw Simoona, tana hayssatappe aathada dosay?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Simoon Phexiroosi, “Ee Godaw, taani nena doseyssa ne eraasa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi iyaakko, “Ta dorssa marata heemma” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesuusi qassika, “Yoona na7aw Simoona, tana dosay?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Simoon Phexiroosi, “Ee Godaw, taani nena doseyssa ne eraasa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi, “Ta dorssata heemma” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesuusi heedzantho, “Yoona na7aw Simoona, tana dosay?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi heedzantho Simoon Phexiroosakko, “Tana dosay?” yaagidi oychchida gisho, Phexiroosi azzanidi, “Godaw, neeni ubbabaa eraasa; taani nena doseyssa ne eraasa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi, “Ta dorssata heemma. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Taani new tuma odays; neeni na7atethan de7iya wode, nerkka danccettada, ne koyida soo baasa. Shin ne cimida wode ne kushiya micca bessana. Hari danccisana; ne dosonna soo efana” yaagis. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesuusi hessa Phexiroosi ay mela hayqo hayqqidi, Xoossaa bonchchisaneekko erisanaw gis. Hessa gidaappe guye, Yesuusi Phexiroosakko, “Tana kaalla” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusanne hankko tamaariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Phexiroosi guye simmidi, Yesuusi dosiya tamaarey baappe guyera yeyssa be7is. He tamaarey, kaho miyason Yesuusakko shiiqidi, “Godaw, nena aathi immanay oonee?” gidayssa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:25">Yoha 13:25</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v"/>Phexiroosi he tamaariya be7idi, “Godaw, ha addey qassi waananee?” yaagidi Yesuusa oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesuusi iyaakko, “Taani yaana gakkanaw I daana mela taani koykko, hessi nena ay metidee? Neeni tana kaalla” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, he tamaarey hayqqenna giya oday ishata ubbaa gakkis. Shin Yesuusi, “Taani yaana gakkanaw, I daana mela taani koykko nena ay metidee?” yaagisippe attin “Hayqqenna” gibeenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ha odabaa markkattidaynne hayssa xaafiday he tamaariya. Iya markkatethay tuma gideyssa nuuni eroos.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesuusi oothida hara darobay de7ees. Ta qoppin, ubbabay huu7en huu7en xaafettidaakko, xaafettiya maxaafatas kumetha alamey wothanw gidanabaa daanenna.</para>
  <para style="restore">02-Oct-2008@09:05, Backup Description=23-Sep-2008@16:55, Ed Owen -</para>
</usx>
